02:17:54.840 --> 02:17:57.950
No, it seems that it died as it was said.

02:17:57.950 --> 02:18:00.000
Moreover, the Sylarg...

02:18:00.090 --> 02:18:02.120
The city?

02:18:02.120 --> 02:18:05.190
The city that was destroyed by the battle of the Copy Reds...

02:18:05.190 --> 02:18:06.260
Was it originally like this?

02:18:06.260 --> 02:18:10.080
Probably, the Hellmasters made Gowrie-sama their hostage

02:18:10.080 --> 02:18:14.080
and planned to do something to Rina-san in the town of Cylarg.

02:18:14.080 --> 02:18:15.100
Probably.

02:18:15.100 --> 02:18:17.960
That's why it's impossible for them not to go.

02:18:17.960 --> 02:18:18.970
In that case...

02:18:18.970 --> 02:18:20.750
For Gowrie-sama's sake...

02:18:20.750 --> 02:18:24.580
We have to use all means to get rid of the Hellmasters

02:18:24.580 --> 02:18:27.470
and save Gowrie-sama!

02:18:27.470 --> 02:18:29.830
To send money or anger to the Hellmasters...

02:18:30.190 --> 02:18:32.720
Let's go, Rina-san, to Sylarg!

02:18:32.720 --> 02:18:35.760
Haah, it seems like it's futile to stop.

02:18:35.760 --> 02:18:51.780
If I can meet Holy-sama safely, I'm thinking of traveling with you for a while.

02:18:51.780 --> 02:18:53.780
Eh? That's fine, isn't it?

02:18:53.780 --> 02:18:54.960
Is that fine?

02:18:54.960 --> 02:18:59.700
There are already five of us. I don't think it's going to change even if there are six of us.

02:19:00.000 --> 02:19:04.660
Rina-san, if you manage to get rid of the Hellmasters and save Gauri-sama, you'll be able to...

02:19:04.660 --> 02:19:05.230
Eh?

02:19:05.230 --> 02:19:08.070
Of course! First you'll have to give me the Sword of Light!

02:19:08.070 --> 02:19:10.520
Ah, that's not it...

02:19:10.520 --> 02:19:16.640
Rina-san, when I asked you before, you said that the purpose of your journey with Gauri-sama was the Sword of Light, right?

02:19:16.640 --> 02:19:17.880
I did.

02:19:17.880 --> 02:19:21.820
Even now, is that the only reason you want to go on a journey with Gauri-sama?

02:19:21.820 --> 02:19:22.680
Huh?

02:19:22.680 --> 02:19:25.220
If that's the case, then I...

02:19:42.160 --> 02:19:44.160
I wish I could have you disappear.

02:19:44.160 --> 02:19:45.140
Fibrido?

02:20:00.760 --> 02:20:07.470
He'll take care of the light and entrust it to his subordinates, isn't he doing a great job?

02:20:07.470 --> 02:20:09.100
He's safe, isn't he?

02:20:09.100 --> 02:20:12.390
He's safe for now.

02:20:12.390 --> 02:20:15.470
But it's boring to just wait and see.

02:20:15.470 --> 02:20:18.530
It's boring for you to just travel, isn't it?

02:20:18.530 --> 02:20:20.820
I brought you here with me.

02:20:20.820 --> 02:20:24.530
Well, I want you to enjoy it as if you're on a trip.

02:20:24.530 --> 02:20:26.160
You're being careless.

02:20:26.160 --> 02:20:28.680
It's the first gate of the Gaori-Takukai.

02:20:34.060 --> 02:20:37.210
If you're going to die in a bad way, that's what you've been doing all this time.

02:20:37.210 --> 02:20:37.890
Let's go!

02:20:37.890 --> 02:20:44.760
Yeah!

02:20:44.760 --> 02:20:45.880
Azebra!

02:21:05.980 --> 02:21:06.790
I'm sorry, dad.

02:21:32.780 --> 02:21:34.740
As always...

02:21:34.740 --> 02:21:36.490
Your opponent is me!

02:21:37.510 --> 02:21:52.300
Blood Art!

02:21:52.300 --> 02:21:58.140
Unblast!

02:21:58.140 --> 02:22:00.000
Blood Blast!

02:22:34.000 --> 02:22:37.940
The only thing he can do is to completely draw out the power of the Sword of the World.

02:22:37.940 --> 02:22:39.700
He's really good at it.

02:22:39.700 --> 02:22:44.600
Albine, it would have been a good match if Gowrie was here.

02:23:20.800 --> 02:23:25.690
I can only avoid the sword of light

02:23:25.690 --> 02:23:30.000
It's impossible to defeat it with a normal hand

02:23:31.440 --> 02:23:34.040
He's about to get serious, too.

02:23:41.170 --> 02:23:41.680
Everyone!

02:24:07.740 --> 02:24:08.580
You can accuse yourself.

02:24:31.600 --> 02:24:39.600
If he has that much speed, then that spell would probably surpass the absorption power of the sword of light, but...

02:25:00.920 --> 02:25:05.530
As usual, he seems to be getting into trouble.

02:25:05.530 --> 02:25:06.210
That guy!

02:25:06.210 --> 02:25:07.600
Zungle!

02:25:07.600 --> 02:25:09.000
Why are you here?

02:25:09.000 --> 02:25:10.210
How's Gowrie?

02:25:10.210 --> 02:25:12.440
Eh?

02:25:12.440 --> 02:25:14.860
Have you been following Gowrie all this time?

02:25:14.860 --> 02:25:16.310
Leave me alone!

02:25:16.310 --> 02:25:17.150
That's right.

02:25:17.150 --> 02:25:20.910
Gowrie isn't here, but he's a great swordsman for you.

02:25:20.910 --> 02:25:22.690
And he's got Gowrie's sword of light.

02:25:22.690 --> 02:25:24.800
Sounds like it.

02:25:24.800 --> 02:25:30.000
Howling Sword, part two!

02:25:33.320 --> 02:25:34.940
What's next?

02:25:38.250 --> 02:25:39.200
This guy...

02:25:48.330 --> 02:25:51.110
Watch out!

02:25:51.110 --> 02:25:51.760
He stopped moving!

02:26:36.940 --> 02:26:37.900
The Bargain Network.

02:26:38.220 --> 02:26:39.540
The Play...

02:28:24.760 --> 02:28:29.830
That's right. I'm completely in control of this man's mind right now.

02:28:31.150 --> 02:28:32.480
You bastard!

02:28:32.480 --> 02:28:35.630
That man was an unimaginably broad-minded man.

02:28:35.630 --> 02:28:39.240
I never thought he would be so skilled in swords.

02:28:39.240 --> 02:28:46.680
Well, I'm the one who's pulling out the true power of the sword of light.

02:28:46.680 --> 02:28:56.570
Certainly, a full-power sword of light and Gowrie's unwavering skill are both troublesome.

02:28:56.570 --> 02:28:57.850
Interesting, isn't it?

02:28:57.850 --> 02:29:00.000
That's exactly what this Zangurusi wants.

02:29:01.180 --> 02:29:03.060
Hey, Zanglis!

02:29:03.060 --> 02:29:06.570
I'm sorry, but you're not my target.

02:29:06.570 --> 02:29:07.770
What did you say?

02:29:07.770 --> 02:29:12.160
My target is just Rina Inverse.

02:29:12.160 --> 02:29:13.020
But...

02:29:13.020 --> 02:29:18.370
I can't help it if you get caught up in the story.

02:29:30.000 --> 02:29:36.030
I've made a lot of things happen, so you can look forward to it!

02:29:49.070 --> 02:29:50.060
What are you talking about?

02:29:50.060 --> 02:29:55.180
You mean that Hellmaster Fibriso took Gaori away?

02:29:55.180 --> 02:30:00.000
Yeah, and then he got turned into a puppet.

02:30:00.030 --> 02:30:04.680
Not only did you take Gowri's life, but you even controlled Gowri's heart that was burning with justice.

02:30:04.680 --> 02:30:09.320
How cowardly is that Fibrizo?

02:30:09.320 --> 02:30:12.940
But why did you take Gowri hostage?

02:30:12.940 --> 02:30:19.350
If the opponent is that big, it would be easy to take your lives.

02:30:19.350 --> 02:30:21.950
His aim is me.

02:30:21.950 --> 02:30:24.710
He wants me to do something.

02:30:24.710 --> 02:30:28.680
In exchange for Gowri's life?

02:30:32.810 --> 02:30:38.130
The only thing I can say is that I don't like being the way Fibriso wants me to be.

02:30:38.130 --> 02:30:40.990
You don't have to force yourself to come with me.

02:30:40.990 --> 02:30:45.230
Zungles is not a participant in the incident.

02:30:45.230 --> 02:30:49.050
Of course I don't intend to go with you guys.

02:30:49.050 --> 02:30:50.930
I'll chase him alone.

02:30:50.930 --> 02:30:54.790
But you're going to fight with me, aren't you?

02:30:54.790 --> 02:30:57.630
I'll settle things with Gowrie again.

02:30:57.630 --> 02:30:59.700
I'll kill everyone who gets in his way.

02:31:02.040 --> 02:31:05.810
Besides, I'm not very good at group activities.

02:31:05.810 --> 02:31:09.570
I'll let you do what you want.

02:31:12.460 --> 02:31:18.430
He's so cool!

02:31:18.430 --> 02:31:23.120
Oh, and he's wearing a slightly bent hat and a nice shirt...

02:31:23.120 --> 02:31:24.740
Oh, no, no!

02:31:24.740 --> 02:31:27.530
I should have sworn that I don't trust anyone anymore, right?

02:31:27.530 --> 02:31:30.000
Now I just have to get revenge for Mr. Jammerguster...

02:31:30.860 --> 02:31:32.280
I'm sorry, Maltia.

02:31:32.280 --> 02:31:35.790
But, but...

02:31:36.790 --> 02:31:40.620
I've been thinking about it for a long time, but he doesn't have a sense.

02:31:40.620 --> 02:31:46.620
Leave it alone.

02:31:46.620 --> 02:31:52.620
Sylphiel's birthplace, Sairag.

02:31:52.620 --> 02:31:56.050
This is the second time we've come to this town.

02:32:02.360 --> 02:32:06.020
During the battle with the copy-red, who became the demon Danuffer,

02:32:06.020 --> 02:32:09.670
this city was supposed to be destroyed by that battle.

02:32:09.670 --> 02:32:14.240
Everything is as Sir Fil said.

02:32:14.240 --> 02:32:17.420
I don't think the city will be restored this soon.

02:32:17.420 --> 02:32:18.680
You're right.

02:32:18.680 --> 02:32:20.910
There's no point in that.

02:32:20.910 --> 02:32:22.410
We'll know when we go.

02:32:22.410 --> 02:32:24.100
If we don't go, we won't know.

02:32:25.940 --> 02:32:30.000
The Fragments are the support of our hearts.

02:32:30.570 --> 02:32:33.170
The new sage, Fragun, is here.

02:32:36.770 --> 02:32:38.770
You smell so bad.

02:32:38.770 --> 02:32:45.000
I'm the princess, and you're the second?

02:32:47.460 --> 02:32:54.840
"Let's go inside the city!"

02:32:54.840 --> 02:32:56.270
"What?"

02:32:56.270 --> 02:32:58.270
"This is not a newly built city."

02:32:58.270 --> 02:33:00.000
"The city that was destroyed in that battle..."

02:33:01.600 --> 02:33:02.600
He's still alive.

02:33:02.600 --> 02:33:21.740
What?

02:33:21.740 --> 02:33:25.960
When he was a child, he measured his height every year.

02:33:49.450 --> 02:33:54.840
This tree should have died in the battle at that time, but it has returned to its original state.

02:33:54.840 --> 02:33:59.240
That's the proof that this town has returned to its original state.

02:33:59.240 --> 02:34:00.000
Ridiculous.

02:34:00.570 --> 02:34:02.690
This city is in a fight against the Copy Reds!

02:34:32.780 --> 02:34:35.260
My father...

02:34:35.260 --> 02:34:42.570
No!

02:34:42.570 --> 02:34:44.020
Why?

02:34:44.020 --> 02:34:47.540
Feel...

02:35:00.190 --> 02:35:01.190
Silphiel...

02:35:01.190 --> 02:35:19.930
You're here, aren't you?

02:35:19.930 --> 02:35:21.960
At this time...

02:35:21.960 --> 02:35:24.440
That's...

02:35:24.440 --> 02:35:27.360
I'm sorry about the reunion, but...

02:35:27.360 --> 02:35:28.500
I'm not, Lord Bers.

02:35:28.500 --> 02:35:30.000
What do you mean?

02:35:30.090 --> 02:35:32.110
Can you explain what this is all about?

02:35:32.110 --> 02:35:34.900
Why has this town become like this?

02:35:34.900 --> 02:35:50.440
Not all the people of this town, including myself, are alive.

02:35:50.440 --> 02:35:51.590
I suppose so.

02:35:51.590 --> 02:35:55.830
This town was revived by the magic of Lord Fibrizo.

02:35:55.830 --> 02:35:59.950
It is the town of those who were given temporary lives.

02:36:03.000 --> 02:36:05.040
What do you mean by your own life?

02:36:05.200 --> 02:36:13.250
All of you, including me, are supposed to be sleeping in the underworld.

02:36:35.820 --> 02:36:37.820
What is the purpose of Fibriso doing such a thing?

02:36:37.820 --> 02:36:42.830
We were not made to answer that question.

02:36:42.830 --> 02:36:49.610
Only the information that has been granted by Lord Fibriso can be conveyed to you.

02:36:49.610 --> 02:36:55.200
Just as people cannot breathe underwater without the help of magic,

02:36:55.200 --> 02:37:00.000
we were made by Lord Fibriso to not be able to answer that question.

02:37:01.180 --> 02:37:09.700
I think it's a bit of a shame to say this, but...

02:37:09.700 --> 02:37:11.990
Tch, what a guy!

02:37:11.990 --> 02:37:16.220
For us, Lord Fibrizo is the same as the Creator.

02:37:16.220 --> 02:37:18.110
We can't go against him.

02:37:18.110 --> 02:37:20.220
Then I'll ask you another question.

02:37:20.220 --> 02:37:23.290
Where is Fibrizo right now?

02:37:23.290 --> 02:37:25.650
In the center of this town.

02:37:25.650 --> 02:37:29.190
In Lord Fibrizo's temple.

