02:41:03.640 --> 02:41:06.510
Nina-san, this isn't the time for you to play!

02:41:06.510 --> 02:41:10.650
That's not true. You're going to come out no matter what!

02:41:10.650 --> 02:41:14.150
If you think it's a lie, then go ahead and do it!

02:41:14.150 --> 02:41:17.190
The sound is...

02:41:17.190 --> 02:41:21.660
What's going on here?

02:41:21.660 --> 02:41:26.620
It seems that the space inside is twisted, and no matter what you do, it seems that you will come out.

02:41:26.620 --> 02:41:27.620
What happened?

02:41:27.620 --> 02:41:30.000
I don't want to go inside.

02:41:30.600 --> 02:41:31.890
For now.

02:41:31.890 --> 02:41:39.480
I'll find you a place.

02:42:08.350 --> 02:42:11.630
It's a bit dangerous, but let's split up and find another entrance.

02:42:11.630 --> 02:42:12.470
Yeah.

02:42:12.470 --> 02:42:17.010
Maybe there's a underground tunnel left from when the FRAGUN was here.

02:42:17.010 --> 02:42:19.880
Okay, let's go over there.

02:42:19.880 --> 02:42:23.400
I don't know what FIGRIZO is up to, so I don't know what he's up to.

02:42:23.400 --> 02:42:27.270
Everyone, be careful.

02:42:27.270 --> 02:42:29.920
Well, let's meet up later.

02:42:56.400 --> 02:42:59.160
You were going to go to the Fibrido temple, weren't you?

02:43:03.420 --> 02:43:05.420
But we can't go inside, can we?

02:43:06.160 --> 02:43:08.160
I don't think there's a normal way to do it.

02:43:08.990 --> 02:43:10.990
But with my Ragna Blade,

02:43:11.190 --> 02:43:13.190
I can cut through that bent space.

02:43:13.620 --> 02:43:15.120
I wonder if I can do it.

02:43:15.790 --> 02:43:18.910
So you were going to fight alone from the beginning, weren't you?

02:43:19.680 --> 02:43:22.680
I was the cause of Gaori's arrest.

02:43:23.760 --> 02:43:26.760
I can't let everyone else be in danger anymore.

02:43:27.400 --> 02:43:28.130
That's...

02:43:28.190 --> 02:43:30.000
T-Breeze has been fighting until now.

02:43:30.000 --> 02:43:32.000
I have the power to make a big difference.

02:43:32.540 --> 02:43:35.540
I'm not even close to that copy-res or Xanapha!

02:43:36.180 --> 02:43:39.600
I'm sorry, but I'm the only one who can deal with that properly.

02:43:39.600 --> 02:43:44.550
I'll go on my own.

02:43:44.550 --> 02:43:47.990
If Amelia-san and Zergadish-san find out later, they'll get angry.

02:43:47.990 --> 02:43:51.880
If you can come back alive, I'll get as angry as you want.

02:43:51.880 --> 02:43:54.550
Well, that's how it is. So is Silphile.

02:43:54.550 --> 02:43:55.550
I'll go with you.

02:43:55.550 --> 02:43:57.970
No, I'll go with you.

02:43:57.970 --> 02:43:59.320
Hey, Silphile!

02:44:00.830 --> 02:44:02.120
I won't forgive you.

02:44:02.120 --> 02:44:03.500
About Gowrie-sama...

02:44:03.500 --> 02:44:04.570
That's right, but...

02:44:04.570 --> 02:44:05.570
Father...

02:44:05.570 --> 02:44:08.770
He's controlling the people of this town of Sairag as he pleases.

02:44:08.770 --> 02:44:11.330
The hybridism...

02:44:11.330 --> 02:44:13.330
Even if I know that I'm not supposed to be alive...

02:44:13.330 --> 02:44:14.890
Tomorrow, Father...

02:44:14.890 --> 02:44:15.970
Please go home.

02:44:15.970 --> 02:44:18.520
That day...

02:44:18.520 --> 02:44:21.170
The fact that I was dragged into the battle and died...

02:44:21.170 --> 02:44:24.160
I thought it was a lie...

02:44:24.160 --> 02:44:25.740
It's unfair, isn't it?

02:44:25.740 --> 02:44:26.440
This is...

02:44:26.440 --> 02:44:30.000
I...

02:44:30.640 --> 02:44:31.830
I'm sorry.

02:44:31.830 --> 02:44:35.790
Anyway, I won't let Fiebrezo, who defies death, stay like this!

02:44:35.790 --> 02:44:40.190
I have to take him down with one blow!

02:44:40.190 --> 02:44:42.180
Rina-san...

02:44:42.180 --> 02:44:43.670
It can't be helped.

02:44:43.670 --> 02:44:48.730
In return, there's no guarantee that you'll be able to come back safely.

02:44:50.810 --> 02:44:52.800
In the battle against Poppy Red,

02:44:52.800 --> 02:44:55.670
the two of us were running underground like dragons.

02:44:55.670 --> 02:44:57.640
That's right.

02:44:57.640 --> 02:45:00.000
But, Rina-san, Fiebrezo is...

02:45:02.400 --> 02:45:05.890
To use the Gigaslave on me and make it run rampant!

02:45:05.890 --> 02:45:07.010
What should we do?

02:45:07.010 --> 02:45:10.620
If I tell you to summon that spell in exchange for Gaori-sama's life?

02:45:10.620 --> 02:45:13.040
Hmph, I don't know if I'm being honest.

02:45:13.040 --> 02:45:16.750
Before I knew the true nature of the Lord of Nightmares,

02:45:16.750 --> 02:45:20.170
I told you that I had to make the spell run rampant.

02:45:20.170 --> 02:45:21.170
Then...

02:45:21.170 --> 02:45:24.900
I don't have the confidence to completely control that spell.

02:45:24.900 --> 02:45:28.590
But I can't just leave Gaori as it is, taken hostage.

02:45:28.590 --> 02:45:30.000
You're right!

02:45:43.440 --> 02:45:46.780
So that's what you're thinking, huh?

02:45:46.780 --> 02:45:49.720
You're being manipulated by that Fibriso!

02:45:49.720 --> 02:45:56.420
I can't do anything about it!

02:45:56.420 --> 02:45:58.530
In that case, we have no choice but to go to the top!

02:45:58.530 --> 02:46:00.000
Rina-san, look!

02:46:01.760 --> 02:46:04.230
I can't even go to the sky with a wing.

02:46:04.230 --> 02:46:08.480
The cover is perfect.

02:46:08.480 --> 02:46:10.570
I wonder if Rina and the others...

02:46:10.570 --> 02:46:11.840
Maybe.

02:47:00.280 --> 02:47:08.880
Close your eyes, Lime-sensei!

02:47:08.880 --> 02:47:13.940
I can't open my eyes. I have to defeat the Fibrids who are controlling me.

02:47:13.940 --> 02:47:14.940
But if I keep this up...

02:47:14.940 --> 02:47:22.550
What's wrong? You're not like yourself.

02:47:22.550 --> 02:47:23.990
Angus!

02:47:23.990 --> 02:47:25.990
Are you going to pity the enemy?

02:47:25.990 --> 02:47:27.990
Don't say stupid things!

02:47:27.990 --> 02:47:30.000
These people will be controlled by the Fibrids!

02:47:32.650 --> 02:47:33.840
I see.

02:47:33.840 --> 02:47:36.100
It has nothing to do with me.

02:47:36.100 --> 02:47:39.280
I'll kill everyone who dares to do so!

02:47:41.870 --> 02:47:44.080
Follow me!

02:47:44.080 --> 02:47:45.860
I'm going to get you!

02:47:45.860 --> 02:47:50.070
I don't know if I'm going to do it or not.

02:47:50.070 --> 02:47:51.980
But for now, let's go.

02:47:51.980 --> 02:47:53.580
Let's go, Silphine.

02:47:53.580 --> 02:47:55.070
Yes.

02:47:55.070 --> 02:47:57.680
One or two.

02:47:57.680 --> 02:47:59.670
One or two.

02:48:05.440 --> 02:48:20.480
Does the Juri Jutsu work?

02:48:20.480 --> 02:48:22.360
Don't be such a mischievous swordsman.

02:48:22.360 --> 02:48:24.230
You won't get a scratch on that wall.

02:48:30.090 --> 02:48:33.750
I will break free from the shackles of the sky.

02:48:33.750 --> 02:48:35.750
My black, waning blade.

02:48:35.750 --> 02:48:36.770
My power.

02:48:36.770 --> 02:48:37.660
I will become yours.

02:48:37.660 --> 02:48:39.550
Together, we will walk the path of destruction.

02:48:39.550 --> 02:48:42.780
I will crush both the gods and their souls!

02:48:42.780 --> 02:48:44.950
To Ragnarok!

02:49:15.870 --> 02:49:18.300
It's time for a show, isn't it?

02:49:18.300 --> 02:49:21.180
I'm finally going to enter the temple.

02:49:21.180 --> 02:49:23.920
I'm going to play a little more.

02:49:23.920 --> 02:49:25.200
It's about time for you to play.

02:49:25.200 --> 02:49:26.740
Let's end it.

02:49:26.740 --> 02:49:27.750
I'm going to deny it.

02:49:32.810 --> 02:49:34.970
I'm gonna go to help you.

02:51:00.060 --> 02:51:04.520
In order to save Gauri, we have arrived at Sairaag.

02:51:04.520 --> 02:51:10.440
The city of Sairaag is now under the control of Fibrizo's magic.

02:51:10.440 --> 02:51:17.190
And now, Fibrizo's hands are tied.

02:51:17.190 --> 02:51:18.880
Lina, the final decision!

02:52:09.970 --> 02:52:12.100
There's no end to this!

02:52:55.530 --> 02:52:55.990
We'll be right back.

02:53:01.880 --> 02:53:08.300
Looks like you want me to go that far.

02:53:08.300 --> 02:53:20.990
I can't get out of here.

02:53:20.990 --> 02:53:21.640
Rin...

02:54:05.150 --> 02:54:10.900
That's...

02:54:10.900 --> 02:54:19.340
What are they?

02:54:19.340 --> 02:54:22.130
They're the people who lived in the castle.

02:54:22.130 --> 02:54:23.110
What?

02:54:23.110 --> 02:54:25.120
They're the people who lived in my castle.

02:54:43.500 --> 02:54:47.860
Thank you for coming, girls. I've been waiting for you.

02:54:47.860 --> 02:54:50.630
What is this little naughty kid?

02:54:50.630 --> 02:54:52.580
That's Feeb-Rizzo.

02:54:52.580 --> 02:54:55.800
What?

02:55:01.310 --> 02:55:10.610
I don't like the way you make fun of people like that, but that power is two or three times stronger than the demons of the past.

02:55:10.610 --> 02:55:17.500
I see. You're the one who makes you say that much.

02:55:17.500 --> 02:55:20.180
More importantly, what does that mean?

02:55:20.180 --> 02:55:22.700
Oh, this?

02:55:22.700 --> 02:55:24.560
It's a pretty good object, isn't it?

02:55:24.560 --> 02:55:27.060
It's just a bad habit!

02:55:27.060 --> 02:55:30.000
This is the human who died in this Cylarg.

02:55:30.060 --> 02:55:31.910
This is our soul.

02:55:37.260 --> 02:55:43.670
The one who's rampaging outside is my power, the shadow that reflected the human form.

02:55:43.670 --> 02:55:48.160
A convenient doll that moves as I want it to.

02:55:48.160 --> 02:55:57.290
After all, my subordinates were destroyed a thousand years ago.

02:55:57.290 --> 02:55:59.820
Zeroth also moved due to an injury the other day.

02:56:01.530 --> 02:56:03.430
for helping me out.

02:56:03.430 --> 02:56:06.010
I'm sorry.

02:56:06.010 --> 02:56:09.010
Did you think I'd shoot Gigaslave for that?

02:56:09.010 --> 02:56:10.440
I'm sure you did.

02:56:10.440 --> 02:56:11.760
But...

02:56:11.760 --> 02:56:12.710
All I had to do...

02:56:12.710 --> 02:56:16.130
was to get them to follow you without letting you run away.

02:56:16.130 --> 02:56:17.420
In that sense...

02:56:17.420 --> 02:56:19.880
I've done a great job.

02:56:19.880 --> 02:56:20.940
But!

02:56:20.940 --> 02:56:23.070
Wait!

02:56:23.070 --> 02:56:24.070
Before that, one more thing.

02:56:24.070 --> 02:56:26.290
Where's Gowrie?

02:56:26.290 --> 02:56:27.600
Right, right.

02:56:27.600 --> 02:56:29.380
That big brother.

02:56:41.480 --> 02:56:44.010
Don't worry, I'm not going to die.

02:56:44.010 --> 02:56:49.690
For now,

02:56:49.690 --> 02:56:51.690
those who are trapped in the crystal alive

02:56:51.690 --> 02:56:53.800
will slowly absorb the biological energy

02:56:53.800 --> 02:56:55.800
and die.

02:56:55.800 --> 02:56:59.860
This big brother will soon be like that too.

02:57:02.300 --> 02:57:06.210
If you don't want to die, you have to defeat me.

02:57:06.210 --> 02:57:09.040
That's the only way.

02:57:09.040 --> 02:57:11.540
Then let's get to the point.

02:57:11.540 --> 02:57:13.430
I'm going to beat you to death!

02:57:18.160 --> 02:57:27.760
You don't seem to understand the difference in power between me and you.

02:57:27.760 --> 02:57:28.450
It's fine.

02:57:33.520 --> 02:57:35.760
I'll teach you one more time.

02:57:38.810 --> 02:57:39.730
There's no end to this!

02:57:39.730 --> 02:57:46.180
Amelia!

02:57:52.110 --> 02:57:52.610
Amelia!

02:57:53.380 --> 02:57:56.290
I might not be able to do this...

02:57:56.290 --> 02:57:58.260
At this rate...

02:58:00.380 --> 02:58:01.360
I have a plan!

02:58:01.360 --> 02:58:02.360
Marishira, let's go!

02:58:02.360 --> 02:58:04.490
I found the escape route!

02:58:04.490 --> 02:58:05.380
Escape route?

02:58:05.380 --> 02:58:06.380
Where?

02:58:06.380 --> 02:58:07.380
Here!

02:58:07.380 --> 02:58:08.380
Ebisubring!

02:58:13.960 --> 02:58:19.550
It's underground.

02:58:19.550 --> 02:58:22.540
In this town, Nagorino who had a FRAGUN.

02:58:22.540 --> 02:58:26.060
If it's a kid, they won't come.

02:58:26.060 --> 02:58:28.710
Sorry, but you can cast a healing spell yourself.

02:58:30.920 --> 02:58:31.510
Let's go!

02:59:01.280 --> 02:59:03.960
I don't think even a drug slave would be able to communicate with the Hibrizo.

02:59:03.960 --> 02:59:06.550
Anyway, please.

02:59:06.550 --> 02:59:09.220
I'm not sure, but I'll give it a try.

02:59:09.220 --> 02:59:20.200
With the power of all of Nanji's family and Nanji,

02:59:20.200 --> 02:59:22.120
you finally gave me more experience.

02:59:22.120 --> 02:59:23.140
Onee-chan.

02:59:23.140 --> 02:59:24.960
I can't see the darkness more than the twilight,

02:59:24.960 --> 02:59:27.000
I can't see the redness more than the flow of blood,

02:59:27.000 --> 02:59:28.520
I'm buried in the flow of time,

02:59:28.520 --> 02:59:30.000
and I can't remember the name of the great Nanji,

02:59:30.600 --> 02:59:32.470
I swear to the darkness here.

02:59:32.470 --> 02:59:34.420
We will stand before you and...

02:59:34.420 --> 02:59:36.310
...be all foolish!

02:59:36.310 --> 02:59:40.310
What? Ruby Ai-sama's spell?

02:59:40.310 --> 02:59:43.030
I don't hear that.

02:59:43.030 --> 02:59:47.160
Dragon Slay!

02:59:47.160 --> 02:59:55.860
Even the double version is no good?

02:59:55.860 --> 02:59:58.310
Not at all, sister.

02:59:58.310 --> 03:00:00.000
I'm all foolish.

03:00:00.730 --> 03:00:04.360
I will give you the power to destroy the world.

03:00:04.360 --> 03:00:05.040
What?

03:00:05.040 --> 03:00:07.240
Dragostream!

