03:03:14.910 --> 03:03:16.100
This curse will go away.

03:03:16.100 --> 03:03:18.050
Are you kidding me?

03:03:18.050 --> 03:03:22.690
I haven't been killed yet.

03:03:33.040 --> 03:03:34.490
I'm surprised.

03:03:34.490 --> 03:03:37.720
A Drag Slave's double attack...

03:03:37.720 --> 03:03:39.490
I didn't hit it.

03:03:39.490 --> 03:03:41.210
It's the "Tokage no Shippo-kiri".

03:03:43.060 --> 03:03:47.340
You left a part of it and ran away with the whole thing?

03:03:47.340 --> 03:03:52.930
Well, if you hit it properly, I might have been able to respond a little.

03:03:52.930 --> 03:03:55.900
Still, you surprised me.

03:03:55.900 --> 03:03:59.030
I'll have you take the punishment for that.

03:04:14.200 --> 03:04:17.140
What is that?

03:04:17.140 --> 03:04:19.510
It's where you all died.

03:04:19.510 --> 03:04:24.820
That's right, I brought you all here on purpose.

03:04:24.820 --> 03:04:28.580
Rina Inverse, in front of you, I will kill each and every one of you.

03:04:31.280 --> 03:04:35.280
Let me tell you why I'm called the Hell Master.

03:04:36.790 --> 03:04:37.790
First, you.

03:04:44.870 --> 03:04:54.510
Camelia! Camelia!

03:04:58.480 --> 03:04:59.120
Slytherin!

03:05:00.030 --> 03:05:02.590
I can't take this anymore!

03:05:02.590 --> 03:05:06.270
I won't be a character anymore!

03:05:06.270 --> 03:05:08.270
I am the one who controls death.

03:05:08.270 --> 03:05:11.510
Human life is my toy.

03:05:11.510 --> 03:05:20.280
Rina Inverse, didn't you think I wouldn't kill my friends until I shot Gigas Lave?

03:05:20.280 --> 03:05:23.210
Haha, that was sweet.

03:05:23.210 --> 03:05:26.860
I won't forgive you!

03:05:26.860 --> 03:05:29.410
You're worse than twilight.

03:05:30.000 --> 03:05:58.930
The flow of time is more red than the flow of blood. It's great!

03:06:24.800 --> 03:06:30.000
I'm screwed. I can't do it anymore. I'm going to lose, I'm going to lose.

03:06:30.000 --> 03:06:33.790
I'm sorry, but can you at least save my life?

03:06:33.790 --> 03:06:36.090
Zungles!

03:06:36.090 --> 03:06:38.460
Yes, just like that.

03:07:01.120 --> 03:07:02.620
Be careful.

03:07:02.620 --> 03:07:04.550
I can't do anything!

03:07:04.550 --> 03:07:07.520
I can't do anything without you!

03:07:07.520 --> 03:07:08.480
What?

03:07:08.480 --> 03:07:11.670
You have to do what you can with your own power.

03:07:11.670 --> 03:07:14.370
If you can...

03:07:33.640 --> 03:07:34.200
Lin Zilin!

03:08:00.890 --> 03:08:03.990
Please be honest with your feelings.

03:08:03.990 --> 03:08:07.620
I don't know if the world is going to end or not.

03:08:08.540 --> 03:08:09.440
Ouch!

03:08:12.110 --> 03:08:13.290
Maltina!

03:08:13.290 --> 03:08:19.820
Maltina!

03:08:19.820 --> 03:08:24.500
The Giga Slave has become Utsuki.

03:08:24.500 --> 03:08:26.720
If you haven't become Utsuki yet,

03:08:26.720 --> 03:08:29.730
you know what I'm going to do next, don't you?

03:08:36.270 --> 03:08:43.830
This crystal is the one that has crystallized a life far away from the body, and if you break it, it will be a real death.

03:08:43.830 --> 03:08:47.720
But if you defeat me, everyone will be saved. Well, that's a promise.

03:08:47.720 --> 03:08:56.620
This crystal is very beautiful when it's broken. Don't you want to see it?

03:08:56.620 --> 03:08:59.960
Then shoot the Giga Slave. Maybe it will run rampant.

03:09:00.090 --> 03:09:02.590
It's possible that he won't let me kill him.

03:09:03.520 --> 03:09:04.600
Hmm...

03:09:04.600 --> 03:09:07.010
I don't know if I should kill at least one person.

03:09:07.010 --> 03:09:09.740
Then, who should I kill?

03:09:09.740 --> 03:09:13.460
Should I kill this Chimera guy?

03:09:13.460 --> 03:09:15.060
That's right!

03:09:15.060 --> 03:09:16.770
Let's kill this guy!

03:09:16.770 --> 03:09:20.570
Even if I leave him alone, it's about time he died.

03:09:26.910 --> 03:09:30.000
Let me go!

03:09:30.570 --> 03:09:32.330
The power to defeat Giggles...

03:09:32.330 --> 03:09:35.440
If it's for that, I don't care what happens to me!

03:09:35.440 --> 03:09:40.080
More than the darkness, deeper than the night...

03:09:40.080 --> 03:09:43.540
You've finally come to your senses.

03:09:43.540 --> 03:09:46.520
You're right.

03:09:46.520 --> 03:09:48.180
I'm left and right.

03:09:48.180 --> 03:09:50.420
I'm the Dark Lord of the Dark.

03:09:50.420 --> 03:09:54.930
If I let my energy run wild, the world will be destroyed.

03:09:54.930 --> 03:09:58.370
But right now, I choose Gowling over the world!

03:09:58.370 --> 03:09:59.730
Lend me your power!

03:10:02.460 --> 03:10:06.040
How many times have I prayed to you, how many times have I swore to you?

03:10:06.040 --> 03:10:09.540
I will stand before you, I will destroy all your foolishness.

03:10:09.540 --> 03:10:30.000
How many times have I tried to give you strength, to give you a little bit of destruction?

03:10:33.680 --> 03:10:39.570
I will destroy that body at this moment, and release the power of the true self!

03:10:45.860 --> 03:10:49.270
I will pierce through that body at the time of my death!

03:11:31.240 --> 03:11:35.130
To those who stand in front of me and desire to perish,

03:11:35.130 --> 03:11:36.210
No way!

03:11:36.210 --> 03:11:46.850
With my power, I will give you destruction.

03:11:46.850 --> 03:11:55.250
To all the mothers of darkness.

03:11:55.250 --> 03:12:00.000
To those who dream of the day when they return in the form of fire.

03:12:00.670 --> 03:12:24.070
It's a dark night, but it's dark than night. It's a mess of all the messes. The people are like me, that's the Lord of Nightmare.

03:13:45.200 --> 03:13:49.400
Darker than darkness, deeper than the night.

03:13:50.260 --> 03:13:56.120
They call me Lord of the Night.

03:14:30.250 --> 03:14:33.620
This evil spirit of the fire... it's here!

03:14:48.620 --> 03:14:58.900
This curse is melting away...

03:15:02.010 --> 03:15:05.550
I'm not the one who's going to disappear. I'm the one who's going to die.

03:15:05.760 --> 03:15:29.350
I'm the one who's going to die. I'm the one who's going to die. I'm the one who's going to die.

03:15:32.240 --> 03:15:44.620
Heh, I didn't think it would turn out like this.

03:15:44.620 --> 03:15:49.510
Now, when all of my wishes are about to come true...

03:15:49.510 --> 03:15:52.020
I can't believe that such a mess is waiting for me!

03:15:52.020 --> 03:15:56.880
I can't believe that my plan will end up like this!

03:15:56.880 --> 03:16:00.000
I calculated everything, and made a mistake!

03:16:00.090 --> 03:16:04.040
I can't believe this plan is going to turn around at the capital!

03:16:10.060 --> 03:16:15.290
I want to destroy the army at the capital!

03:16:15.290 --> 03:16:22.290
I want to destroy the army at the capital!

03:16:22.290 --> 03:16:23.290
The ultimate fate of the family...

03:16:23.290 --> 03:16:26.050
The ultimate fate of the family...

03:16:30.700 --> 03:16:31.830
So it was created.

03:17:00.000 --> 03:17:04.000
But that girl's vessel is too small, too small.

03:17:04.000 --> 03:17:15.880
That's why I'm going to crush that girl's body, and release your power!

03:17:15.880 --> 03:17:17.800
Come on, world!

03:17:17.800 --> 03:17:21.440
Come and destroy my friend!

03:17:42.440 --> 03:17:45.850
I am here because of my own will.

03:17:45.850 --> 03:17:48.470
I am here to destroy you.

03:17:48.470 --> 03:17:51.670
I will destroy you as you wish.

03:18:47.790 --> 03:18:51.960
What happened?

03:19:00.700 --> 03:19:27.460
It's not Rina-san.

03:19:32.780 --> 03:19:35.830
showed me a part of Shiju.

03:19:35.830 --> 03:19:39.990
That Okada is the source of all chaos.

03:19:39.990 --> 03:19:41.750
The King of the Conjuring.

03:19:41.750 --> 03:19:43.210
Could it be...

03:19:43.210 --> 03:19:44.010
Lordo?

03:19:44.010 --> 03:19:45.810
Lordo of Nightmare...

03:19:45.810 --> 03:19:49.080
What's wrong with you?

03:19:49.080 --> 03:19:57.220
Okada said,

03:19:57.220 --> 03:19:59.570
"My power is my will."

03:20:00.760 --> 03:20:04.600
The Giga Slave is the Lord of Nightmare itself!

03:20:08.550 --> 03:20:12.230
Rina! What's happened to Rina?!

03:20:12.230 --> 03:20:14.080
Where is Rina-san?!

03:20:14.080 --> 03:20:29.670
According to the will of the one who was called Rina...

03:20:30.000 --> 03:20:32.230
appeared in this land.

03:20:32.230 --> 03:20:33.540
That is,

03:20:33.540 --> 03:20:35.840
to replace everything with myself,

03:20:35.840 --> 03:20:42.960
to save that man's life.

03:20:42.960 --> 03:20:45.630
The most precious wish of those called Rina.

03:20:45.630 --> 03:20:47.020
The true will.

03:20:47.020 --> 03:20:48.820
The pure heart.

03:20:48.820 --> 03:20:51.830
Because of that thought, I am here.

03:20:51.830 --> 03:20:54.000
To replace everything with myself...

03:20:54.000 --> 03:20:57.460
Is that what Rina wanted too?

03:20:57.460 --> 03:21:00.000
To be in the form of nothing...

03:21:00.000 --> 03:21:05.150
In order to be pure, Yuu calls Mu, and Yuu kisses Mu.

03:21:05.150 --> 03:21:07.080
It's a ten-day exchange, isn't it?

03:21:07.080 --> 03:21:16.830
It's already within my chaos, Tokoshii.

03:21:16.830 --> 03:21:19.260
Darn it!

03:21:19.260 --> 03:21:23.030
Don't mess with me, Gai!

03:21:23.030 --> 03:21:30.000
I don't know what's going on, but if I lose Ina, I'll erase it!

03:21:30.700 --> 03:21:32.370
Erase it!

03:21:32.370 --> 03:21:33.290
That's right!

03:21:33.290 --> 03:21:35.670
No matter how much people save you,

03:21:35.670 --> 03:21:37.780
you have to be there!

03:21:37.780 --> 03:21:40.260
That's right.

03:21:40.260 --> 03:21:41.300
Everyone!

03:21:41.300 --> 03:21:45.880
Open your eyes, everyone!

03:22:26.720 --> 03:22:28.570
It's not like I'm in the middle of a debate!

03:22:28.570 --> 03:22:29.860
If you're gonna say that...

03:22:30.160 --> 03:22:32.270
It's inside the castle!

03:22:43.880 --> 03:22:45.400
Let's go, Amelia!

03:22:45.400 --> 03:22:53.460
Yes!

03:22:53.460 --> 03:22:56.500
Marutina! Marutina!

03:22:56.500 --> 03:22:59.730
Now is the time to pray to the Zohar Melchster!

03:23:15.100 --> 03:23:17.100
Don't you dare take Lina with you!

03:23:17.100 --> 03:23:23.330
I'll save you!

03:23:23.330 --> 03:23:25.480
I'll save you!

03:23:38.700 --> 03:23:39.380
Go in!

03:24:17.790 --> 03:24:24.230
Himekuremon, Ijippari, Ohitoyoshi, and Tereya, but...

03:24:24.230 --> 03:24:27.940
The ones weaker than me are the sweetest ones, but...

03:24:27.940 --> 03:24:30.000
I'm...

03:24:31.020 --> 03:24:31.920
Oh my God!

03:27:02.520 --> 03:27:09.150
Gaori, Martina-san, Zungle-san, and everyone else...

03:27:10.240 --> 03:27:20.040
What's going on?

03:27:57.710 --> 03:28:00.000
When did you...

03:28:03.000 --> 03:28:04.460
What am I doing here?

03:28:05.420 --> 03:28:06.700
You, huh?

03:28:07.140 --> 03:28:08.940
What are you doing, you bastard?

03:28:15.770 --> 03:28:19.270
DJ, my body is a d*ck, isn't it?

03:28:19.270 --> 03:28:21.410
Who are you calling a d*ck?

03:28:21.410 --> 03:28:22.830
I am, I am!

03:28:22.830 --> 03:28:25.730
You're so mean, aren't you?

03:28:25.730 --> 03:28:27.070
Give it back!

03:28:27.070 --> 03:28:28.310
Give it back, what are you doing?

03:28:28.310 --> 03:28:29.640
Give it back, give it back!

03:28:34.480 --> 03:28:39.410
The mother of all things is a very fickle person.

03:29:01.720 --> 03:29:15.460
In the end, I used the perfect version of Giga Slave and failed to control the technique properly, and from then on, the darkness disappeared.

03:29:15.460 --> 03:29:22.580
No, I remember that I chased after Lina and jumped into a black mass.

03:29:22.580 --> 03:29:25.580
Well, that might be the case with Gowri-san.

03:29:25.580 --> 03:29:28.020
You...

03:29:28.020 --> 03:29:30.000
You...

03:29:35.150 --> 03:29:37.010
I feel like something happened.

03:29:37.010 --> 03:29:40.950
Something very important.

03:29:40.950 --> 03:29:53.060
Me too.

03:29:53.060 --> 03:29:57.850
I saw it with my own eyes.

03:29:57.850 --> 03:29:58.850
A ghost?

03:30:00.830 --> 03:30:02.310
Of course!

03:30:02.310 --> 03:30:06.880
I won't die to the highest level of the Zorna Kingdom, this Maltina!

03:30:06.880 --> 03:30:08.030
It's fine!

03:30:08.030 --> 03:30:09.720
Zorcloth!

03:30:09.720 --> 03:30:12.550
You're the one who died!

03:30:12.550 --> 03:30:15.560
Well, I guess I'm Zor Melguster's guardian.

03:30:15.560 --> 03:30:18.200
That's right!

03:30:18.200 --> 03:30:21.320
I'm Vivan!

03:30:21.320 --> 03:30:24.540
You didn't just die because you were a gag character, did you?

03:30:24.540 --> 03:30:26.980
Then you don't have a body, do you?

03:30:26.980 --> 03:30:30.000
You guys! This time, we're going to win!

03:30:36.650 --> 03:30:39.990
That's enough. You have to be aware of your feelings.

03:31:03.680 --> 03:31:09.320
Zangief, from today on, you will be the king of Zaana.

03:31:09.320 --> 03:31:11.080
O-Oh...

03:31:11.080 --> 03:31:15.420
Yes, yes, keep going, keep going.

03:31:15.420 --> 03:31:17.540
Those two are really something.

03:31:17.540 --> 03:31:23.260
If that girl can have a child, then I'll be free too.

03:31:23.260 --> 03:31:26.820
You look happy, Marutsume-kun.

03:31:26.820 --> 03:31:29.960
You're so nice, you're a bride, aren't you?

03:31:30.410 --> 03:31:33.840
Weren't you going to be a hero of justice?

03:31:33.840 --> 03:31:38.090
I want to be a hero, but I also want to be a bride!

03:31:48.240 --> 03:31:55.530
Eh?

03:31:55.530 --> 03:31:58.840
I've found your new sword!

03:31:58.840 --> 03:31:59.830
Rina!

03:32:00.120 --> 03:32:01.620
It's not like that.

03:32:05.530 --> 03:32:09.340
I've already taken care of it.

03:32:09.340 --> 03:32:10.020
Why?!

03:32:10.020 --> 03:32:12.000
Oh, it's my sword!

03:32:12.410 --> 03:32:14.450
Oh, that's too much!

03:32:14.450 --> 03:32:16.570
Oh, did I do something wrong?

03:32:16.570 --> 03:32:20.340
No! What have you been doing all this time?

03:32:20.340 --> 03:32:26.790
Well, there's a lot of self-treatment, and it's hard to take care of it.

03:32:26.790 --> 03:32:30.000
Well then, I'll go around here.

03:32:33.680 --> 03:32:37.300
But maybe we'll be able to see each other again soon.

03:32:38.860 --> 03:32:40.220
Oh, Zeros!

03:32:46.350 --> 03:32:48.670
Where are you going?

03:32:48.670 --> 03:32:50.240
I don't know!

03:32:50.240 --> 03:32:52.340
What I know is that I can't help you!

03:32:52.340 --> 03:32:53.880
I can't stop anyone!

03:32:53.880 --> 03:32:57.400
Please help me!

03:32:57.400 --> 03:32:58.590
I'll help you!

03:32:58.590 --> 03:33:00.000
Let's go!

03:35:01.500 --> 03:35:07.430
What? What? The Nine Inverse? Why am I here?

03:35:07.430 --> 03:35:09.990
First of all, I'm going to find out who's the one here.

03:35:09.990 --> 03:35:13.570
Who's the one here?

03:35:30.280 --> 03:35:33.330
So then, the king of the first kingdom who has gathered here.

03:35:33.330 --> 03:35:36.040
I think you already know, but...

03:35:36.040 --> 03:35:42.450
The fact that the barrier of the demon clan, which had been trapped inside us for thousands of years, has disappeared...

03:35:42.450 --> 03:35:46.410
...is undisputedly the truth!

03:35:47.230 --> 03:35:50.180
The fact that the barrier of the demon clan has disappeared...

03:35:50.180 --> 03:35:53.140
...means that we can now live and die in the outside world.

03:35:53.140 --> 03:35:54.130
However...

03:35:54.130 --> 03:35:58.030
No matter what means we use, the barrier that we couldn't break...

03:35:58.030 --> 03:36:00.000
...has suddenly disappeared.

03:36:00.730 --> 03:36:02.050
See for yourself!

03:36:02.050 --> 03:36:07.870
The fact that we can see the pillar of light is proof that the barrier has disappeared!

03:36:07.870 --> 03:36:10.600
But what is that pillar of light?

03:36:10.600 --> 03:36:13.460
I don't know.

03:36:13.460 --> 03:36:18.290
The legends and books we know have nothing to do with it.

03:36:18.290 --> 03:36:21.250
It must be a sign that something bad is about to happen.

03:36:21.250 --> 03:36:22.310
That's right!

03:36:22.310 --> 03:36:24.300
We can't just sit around and wait.

03:36:24.300 --> 03:36:28.610
The countries outside the world may invade us with their own power.

03:36:30.380 --> 03:36:36.170
Therefore, I, Sailune, have decided to send the Peace Corps to the outside world.

03:36:36.170 --> 03:36:41.390
I would like to ask for the help of the royal family of my country.

03:36:41.390 --> 03:36:50.990
Now, about this plan, on behalf of my father, I, Amelia Will Tesla Sailune, will explain it to you.

03:36:50.990 --> 03:36:58.390
What are you doing? If you don't hurry up, the children will get bad!

03:37:02.170 --> 03:37:03.080
You're the best!

03:37:03.080 --> 03:37:11.240
It's been a thousand years since I've been on a ship that goes to the outside world.

03:37:11.240 --> 03:37:12.800
It's a pretty small ship, isn't it?

03:37:12.800 --> 03:37:14.180
Is that so?

03:37:14.180 --> 03:37:16.890
By the way, Lina, can I ask you something?

03:37:16.890 --> 03:37:17.600
Yes!

03:37:17.600 --> 03:37:20.580
What is the outside world?

03:37:20.580 --> 03:37:24.000
Ah! The hot spring tamago!

03:37:24.000 --> 03:37:26.280
Listen.

03:37:26.280 --> 03:37:30.000
This is roughly what we're living in right now.

03:37:30.730 --> 03:37:34.970
Right now, we're on the coast of this country.

03:37:34.970 --> 03:37:41.110
We couldn't get out of here until now, but the situation has finally changed.

03:37:41.110 --> 03:37:44.340
We have to investigate the outside world.

03:37:44.340 --> 03:37:48.770
The kings of various countries are making money and organizing facilities like this.

03:37:48.770 --> 03:37:50.260
You know a lot.

03:37:50.260 --> 03:37:52.940
You've heard a lot of rumors so far, haven't you?

03:37:52.940 --> 03:37:53.840
Is that so?

03:37:53.840 --> 03:37:55.220
That's right.

03:37:55.220 --> 03:38:00.000
Then why haven't you been able to go outside so far?

03:38:00.510 --> 03:38:04.310
You don't understand from the basics, do you?

03:38:04.310 --> 03:38:08.740
It's fine. It might be useless, but I'll explain it properly.

03:38:08.740 --> 03:38:12.850
The Kouma War, a thousand years ago, when the Demon King Shaburani Gudou was revived.

03:38:12.850 --> 03:38:18.740
Since then, the Kouima clan of the Demon King and his subordinates have established a barrier in this area where we live.

03:38:18.740 --> 03:38:25.950
For that reason, it was almost impossible to go out or enter the outside world.

03:38:25.950 --> 03:38:30.000
But in this era, a dramatic change has occurred!

03:38:32.430 --> 03:38:35.480
That demon king's subordinate, Pibrizo, was defeated!

03:38:35.480 --> 03:38:42.520
It was confirmed that the barrier that surrounded the area where we lived was gone, and we were able to interact with the outside world!

03:38:42.520 --> 03:38:45.340
Wow, there were some amazing wizards.

03:38:45.340 --> 03:38:49.040
It's about me! It's about me!

03:38:49.040 --> 03:38:54.840
And that pillar of light. Since then, I've been able to see that pillar of light.

03:38:54.840 --> 03:38:56.820
I wonder what that is...

03:38:56.820 --> 03:38:59.600
Come on, come on. As usual.

03:39:00.160 --> 03:39:02.300
Long time no see, you two.

03:39:02.300 --> 03:39:03.440
Zell!

03:39:03.440 --> 03:39:06.000
Zellgadis!

03:39:06.000 --> 03:39:10.330
It's been a while, hasn't it?

03:39:10.330 --> 03:39:12.670
You've been doing well since then, haven't you, Zell?

03:39:12.670 --> 03:39:15.190
Well, you two are...

03:39:15.190 --> 03:39:19.940
I can't even imagine you two being so depressed.

03:39:19.940 --> 03:39:23.370
You've been fighting since we last met, haven't you?

03:39:23.370 --> 03:39:24.420
N-No...

03:39:24.420 --> 03:39:28.660
So, Zell, did you come to see the ship that's going to the outside world?

03:39:28.660 --> 03:39:29.600
Yeah.

03:39:31.310 --> 03:39:38.050
Now then, let's think about how we can fix our bodies in the outside world.

03:39:38.050 --> 03:39:41.610
My body is still as it is.

03:39:41.610 --> 03:39:44.930
You're having a hard time too, aren't you?

03:39:44.930 --> 03:39:48.010
What? I'll do it as long as I want.

03:39:48.010 --> 03:39:52.110
But this facility is full of dead people from all over the world, right?

03:39:52.110 --> 03:39:54.140
I wonder if Zeru will be able to dive in.

03:39:54.140 --> 03:39:55.390
I'm sure he will.

03:39:55.390 --> 03:39:59.920
Well, if something happens, I'll try to set up a ship myself.

03:40:00.220 --> 03:40:02.320
It's your fault for giving up, as always.

03:40:02.320 --> 03:40:06.400
So, what are you guys doing here?

03:40:06.400 --> 03:40:10.010
We're here to take the letter's request.

03:40:10.010 --> 03:40:11.400
Request?

03:40:11.400 --> 03:40:16.300
I don't mind the name of the sender, but the amount of requests is huge.

03:40:16.300 --> 03:40:18.540
I came here with a plan.

03:40:18.540 --> 03:40:20.550
Who is it?

03:40:33.580 --> 03:40:35.420
I'm the one who sent you this letter.

03:40:35.420 --> 03:40:36.800
You did?

03:40:36.800 --> 03:40:37.440
Yes.

03:40:37.440 --> 03:40:41.340
My name is Lilia, and I sent this letter to Rina-san.

03:40:41.340 --> 03:40:45.410
And you are Zergadis Greyward-san, right?

03:40:45.410 --> 03:40:48.180
And this is Gauri Gavriath-san.

03:40:48.180 --> 03:40:48.810
Huh?

03:40:48.810 --> 03:40:51.250
So you've been investigating us?

03:40:51.250 --> 03:40:52.250
Yes.

03:40:52.250 --> 03:40:57.320
We've been investigating how you destroyed Hellmaster Fibrizo.

03:40:57.320 --> 03:40:59.030
I see.

03:40:59.030 --> 03:40:59.700
So...

03:41:00.190 --> 03:41:04.240
What do you want us to do now that you know everything?

03:41:04.240 --> 03:41:05.410
That is...

03:41:05.410 --> 03:41:08.630
Hm?

03:41:08.630 --> 03:41:12.510
I will talk to you after I have confirmed your power.

03:41:12.510 --> 03:41:15.450
Our power?

03:41:15.450 --> 03:41:17.660
That's why...

03:41:17.660 --> 03:41:27.270
It's a misunderstanding! I just wanted to say that...

03:41:48.750 --> 03:41:50.750
It's only natural that you were beaten up!

03:41:50.750 --> 03:41:51.750
That's what I'm saying!

03:41:51.750 --> 03:41:52.850
Ouch, ouch, ouch.

03:41:52.850 --> 03:41:53.850
No!

03:41:53.850 --> 03:41:55.200
But why did you...

03:41:55.200 --> 03:41:56.830
I mean, what was it...

03:41:56.830 --> 03:41:59.440
You thought I was going to do a skirt tour or something?

03:42:00.030 --> 03:42:04.990
A skirt flip? N-No way! I just wanted to see what was going on in there!

03:42:04.990 --> 03:42:07.520
That's what you call a skirt flip, isn't it?

03:42:07.520 --> 03:42:09.830
No! My tail!

03:42:09.830 --> 03:42:10.500
Your tail?

03:42:10.500 --> 03:42:13.760
That's right! My sister had a tail growing out of it!

03:42:13.760 --> 03:42:16.580
So that's why you didn't wear a skirt? I see.

03:42:16.580 --> 03:42:23.910
I finally thought I'd be able to get rid of Lina, who has no sense of humor, and help other women, but...

03:42:23.910 --> 03:42:30.000
You know what? I...

03:42:30.960 --> 03:42:37.560
Well, I don't care if that girl is mad at me or not, but at least it's not an ordinary thing to throw that kind of thing around.

03:42:37.560 --> 03:42:43.580
I'm not surprised that there's someone with a tail growing in this world.

03:42:43.580 --> 03:42:45.660
Like a werewolf or a half-giant.

03:42:45.660 --> 03:42:49.450
A woman with a tail growing? That's a big surprise.

03:42:49.450 --> 03:42:55.170
Well, I think so, but don't you think we're already being dragged into something complicated?

03:42:55.170 --> 03:42:58.650
You're right...

03:42:58.650 --> 03:43:00.000
I don't know if I can meet the amount of requests properly.

03:43:00.280 --> 03:43:20.040
Our comrades, we've been trying to step out into the outside world for the first time in a thousand years.

03:43:20.040 --> 03:43:26.980
We can't know what's going on in the outside world right now.

03:43:26.980 --> 03:43:30.000
We can't face it with our will.

03:43:30.220 --> 03:43:32.140
Or is it the other way around?

03:43:32.140 --> 03:43:35.960
There must be a lot of dangers waiting for us.

03:43:35.960 --> 03:43:44.410
But there must be a lot of new possibilities waiting for us.

03:43:44.410 --> 03:43:48.460
That's why we're taking the first step now!

03:43:49.460 --> 03:43:52.020
The map is in front of you!

03:43:52.020 --> 03:43:58.000
Our fleet will avoid the deserts in the south and sail along the coast like this.

03:43:58.000 --> 03:44:00.000
Airship Sailun Seiobe.

03:44:00.480 --> 03:44:02.670
C.F. Doggo, what about the second ship?

03:44:02.670 --> 03:44:11.110
Oh, it seems that Phil-san is the one who is in charge of this facility.

03:44:11.110 --> 03:44:23.310
It seems that he's not here.

03:44:23.310 --> 03:44:26.880
Well, it's fine. I'll push it out later and take it down.

03:44:26.880 --> 03:44:30.000
That's pretty much what the woman called Filia said yesterday.

03:44:30.700 --> 03:44:33.440
I've become a little sad.

03:44:33.440 --> 03:44:35.320
I'll be here.

03:44:35.320 --> 03:44:49.530
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

03:44:49.530 --> 03:44:59.190
I don't think this person is normal.

03:45:00.760 --> 03:45:03.680
It's true that I did it.

03:45:03.680 --> 03:45:09.170
I feel like I forgot about it yesterday.

03:45:09.170 --> 03:45:11.280
So, could it be...

03:45:11.280 --> 03:45:12.100
You...

03:45:12.100 --> 03:45:13.660
It's about this guy.

03:45:13.660 --> 03:45:17.760
What should I do about this?

03:45:17.760 --> 03:45:23.260
So, this is the continuation of what we talked about yesterday, isn't it?

03:45:23.260 --> 03:45:26.680
So, what is the job of paying the price reward?

03:45:26.680 --> 03:45:30.000
I want to ask you to do it after trying our power.

03:45:30.000 --> 03:45:37.130
Yeah, so I'm gonna try the power of all of you.

03:45:37.130 --> 03:45:59.920
If you try the power of all of you, what are you going to do?

03:46:01.440 --> 03:46:03.400
I'm not normal, you know.

03:46:06.530 --> 03:46:10.530
In the name of justice and peace, I give you my best wishes.

03:46:10.530 --> 03:46:12.030
Best wishes!

03:47:07.930 --> 03:47:10.430
I'm on duty right now, so I'll talk to you later.

03:47:10.430 --> 03:47:12.170
Come on, you stink of water.

03:47:23.790 --> 03:47:30.000
Dragon? Why in the world...

03:47:31.500 --> 03:47:33.430
So this is our power test!

03:47:33.430 --> 03:47:36.130
Wow, so this is Rina-san involved in this!

03:47:36.130 --> 03:47:39.030
Yeah, it seems like there's no doubt about it.

03:47:48.280 --> 03:47:53.470
After all, we're the ones after that dragon!

03:47:53.470 --> 03:47:56.730
What are you thinking in a place with so many people like this?!

03:47:56.730 --> 03:47:58.090
What should we do?

03:47:58.090 --> 03:48:00.000
There's no such thing as "what to do" or "how to do it"!

03:48:02.170 --> 03:48:03.370
I see. It's a ship.

03:48:04.620 --> 03:48:06.560
It's fine. I'll get the big guy.

03:48:07.600 --> 03:48:10.200
Why are you dragging me into this?

03:48:17.610 --> 03:48:18.710
Wait a minute.

03:48:18.950 --> 03:48:20.440
This ship is mine.

03:48:20.630 --> 03:48:22.330
The ship and I are one.

03:48:22.480 --> 03:48:23.980
I won't let you do anything to me!

03:48:29.020 --> 03:48:30.000
I'll leave the rest to you!

03:48:30.060 --> 03:48:32.460
I'll leave it to you!

03:48:32.460 --> 03:48:34.570
They're pretty honest with themselves.

03:48:34.570 --> 03:48:36.570
Sailun's boat ride is not a big deal.

03:48:36.570 --> 03:48:38.550
I'll...

03:48:38.550 --> 03:48:40.390
I'll lead!

03:48:40.390 --> 03:48:42.280
Get to the supply base!

03:48:42.280 --> 03:48:44.280
Send signal to the front line! I have the justice!

03:48:44.280 --> 03:48:47.860
All front line defense personnel!

03:48:47.860 --> 03:48:49.810
Full speed ahead!

03:48:49.810 --> 03:48:56.410
All out!

03:48:56.410 --> 03:48:58.640
Oregura!

03:49:47.720 --> 03:49:49.620
Only the Gold Dragon can do this.

03:49:49.620 --> 03:49:51.540
I'm going to do it!

03:49:51.540 --> 03:49:52.540
Is this my turn?

03:50:04.000 --> 03:50:05.060
What are you doing?

03:50:39.820 --> 03:50:43.540
I'm going to get this!

03:51:02.200 --> 03:51:03.200
Aiaizer!

03:51:04.140 --> 03:51:05.440
The darkness of twilight...

03:51:05.830 --> 03:51:07.300
The darkness of blood...

03:51:07.300 --> 03:51:08.780
The darkness of the flow of life...

03:51:08.780 --> 03:51:10.680
The great Nanji's Naniose...

03:51:10.680 --> 03:51:12.160
I swear to the darkness here!

03:51:12.160 --> 03:51:14.160
We will stand before you and...

03:51:14.160 --> 03:51:15.660
To all foolish beings...

03:51:15.660 --> 03:51:17.660
We and Nanji will together...

03:51:17.660 --> 03:51:19.660
Give you all the destruction!

03:51:20.910 --> 03:51:21.600
Dragon!

03:51:41.000 --> 03:51:43.880
If you get caught by Rina, you won't be able to defeat the Old Dragon.

03:51:43.880 --> 03:51:44.340
Huh?

03:51:44.340 --> 03:51:53.160
We have to go back to the port and meet with that girl called Filia!

03:51:53.160 --> 03:51:53.780
Huh?

03:51:53.780 --> 03:51:56.880
Tsura tsura tsura tsura tsura tsura!

03:51:56.880 --> 03:51:59.250
Tsuna?

03:52:05.720 --> 03:52:27.280
What the hell?

03:52:27.280 --> 03:52:29.730
It seems that everyone has been buried.

03:52:30.320 --> 03:52:30.820
That's right.

03:52:33.530 --> 03:52:34.810
I can't do anything about it.

03:52:36.420 --> 03:52:37.680
What are you going to do next?

03:52:37.680 --> 03:52:38.840
I-I'm going to...

03:52:42.550 --> 03:52:44.750
What do you mean, "I'm going to the port"?

03:52:44.750 --> 03:52:47.530
Probably because of the drug slave Yo-ha from earlier...

03:52:47.960 --> 03:52:49.740
You're so annoying...

03:52:49.740 --> 03:52:53.120
Toshima Surina-san...

03:52:53.120 --> 03:52:55.350
Alright! I've decided!

03:52:55.450 --> 03:52:56.630
I'm going to run away like this!

03:52:56.630 --> 03:52:57.710
Ah, no, not like this.

03:52:57.710 --> 03:52:59.730
I'm going to the outside world like this!

03:53:01.400 --> 03:53:03.540
We can't change the direction of the ship.

03:53:03.540 --> 03:53:06.980
We have to take the first step towards the secret world.

03:53:06.980 --> 03:53:08.220
I wonder if that's okay.

03:53:08.220 --> 03:53:10.640
If it's a Ray Wing, we can still change it.

03:53:10.640 --> 03:53:12.070
Don't talk nonsense.

03:53:12.070 --> 03:53:15.880
Datsun, you want to see the outside world, don't you?

03:53:15.880 --> 03:53:20.480
Amelia, you want to spread justice in the outside world and fight evil, don't you?

03:53:20.480 --> 03:53:21.570
Y-Yes.

03:53:21.570 --> 03:53:23.010
Delgadis?

03:53:23.010 --> 03:53:24.790
Of course you don't depend on it, do you?

03:53:24.790 --> 03:53:28.130
Yes, I'm the kind of person who wishes and wishes.

03:53:28.130 --> 03:53:29.860
So, what about Lowry?

03:53:30.030 --> 03:53:31.860
Well, I guess we'll have to see how it goes.

03:53:31.860 --> 03:53:32.720
All right!

03:53:32.720 --> 03:53:35.220
Now that the world is on the stage,

03:53:35.220 --> 03:53:37.110
let's go on a new journey!

03:55:15.580 --> 03:55:21.800
When Master Fibrizo was destroyed, a dramatic change occurred in the continent centered on the Holy Runes.

03:55:21.800 --> 03:55:28.740
Since the Kouma War that occurred a thousand years ago, the barrier of the demons that covered this continent has been removed.

03:55:30.000 --> 03:55:36.040
Therefore, the kings of each country took their hands and sent the facility unit to the outside world.

03:55:36.040 --> 03:55:41.590
However, when it was time to depart, the Golden Dragon suddenly attacked.

03:55:41.590 --> 03:55:46.380
However, the genius beautiful girl magician Rina Inverse appeared there.

03:55:46.380 --> 03:55:50.580
With the help of this Rina-chan, the dragon was shot down.

03:55:50.580 --> 03:56:00.000
But, as a matter of fact, the boat that put us on did not work, and we could not return to the port.

03:56:01.210 --> 03:56:03.720
Let's go to the outside world!

03:56:03.720 --> 03:56:08.680
This time, let's start a new adventure that will take place all over the world!

03:56:41.960 --> 03:56:48.010
I may end up with a life-threatening adventure...

03:56:48.010 --> 03:56:54.840
That's why it's not good to just go with the flow.

03:57:00.090 --> 03:57:08.310
Don't tell me, all the food was thrown out because of that chaos.

03:57:08.310 --> 03:57:18.850
Akane, are we going to die like this?

03:57:18.850 --> 03:57:24.990
I'd like to say that I can't die in a place like this, but I should be prepared.

03:57:24.990 --> 03:57:27.810
It was a fleeting life.

03:57:44.240 --> 03:57:47.250
If there are birds, then there must be land nearby.

03:58:00.190 --> 03:58:00.900
Riku?

03:58:34.480 --> 03:58:36.240
You haven't found it yet, have you?

03:58:36.240 --> 03:58:38.240
The last one.

03:58:38.240 --> 03:58:39.580
Yes, sir.

03:58:39.580 --> 03:58:41.560
You have the Sword of Light.

03:58:41.560 --> 03:58:43.450
You know it.

03:58:43.450 --> 03:58:47.240
Find the last one.

03:58:47.240 --> 03:58:48.180
Yes, sir.

03:59:39.850 --> 03:59:43.170
Listen up! Don't look at me like that!

03:59:43.170 --> 03:59:45.280
Boss, I have something for you.

03:59:45.280 --> 03:59:46.090
What is it?

03:59:46.090 --> 03:59:49.790
Don't worry about it. Just leave it to me.

03:59:49.790 --> 03:59:52.170
Understood.

03:59:52.170 --> 03:59:53.220
And by the way...

03:59:53.220 --> 03:59:55.360
Don't forget to take your treasure!

03:59:55.360 --> 03:59:59.890
Understood!

04:00:05.690 --> 04:00:08.350
Gather all the members of the team from the other side!

04:00:08.350 --> 04:00:10.880
You! Get out of here! Now!

04:00:10.880 --> 04:00:13.040
Help me! Help me!

04:00:13.040 --> 04:00:14.660
Huh?

04:00:48.430 --> 04:00:51.590
Looks like they're being attacked.

04:00:51.590 --> 04:00:53.430
What's wrong with you guys?

04:00:54.720 --> 04:00:57.810
These guys are all weird. They have a weird smell.

04:00:57.810 --> 04:00:58.810
No way!

04:01:02.910 --> 04:01:07.910
Even though we finally made it here, we can't let him get in our way!

04:01:08.910 --> 04:01:13.170
That's right. If we keep this up, we don't know what we're going to do.

04:01:14.170 --> 04:01:15.160
What the hell are you talking about?

04:01:16.160 --> 04:01:19.340
There's no one who can stop me from eating!

04:01:20.320 --> 04:01:21.200
What did you say?

04:01:21.200 --> 04:01:24.530
I can't believe you're forcibly taking away the gold coins from innocent people!

04:01:24.530 --> 04:01:26.530
That is simply evil!

04:01:27.530 --> 04:01:30.000
It's a crime of justice, love, truth, and appetite!

04:01:33.610 --> 04:01:36.960
Wait a minute! What's with your last appetite?!

04:01:36.960 --> 04:01:40.720
Anyway, I guess I'll just have to go home before the sun rises.

04:01:40.720 --> 04:01:43.490
I don't care what happens to the Samurai, I don't care what happens to them!

04:01:43.490 --> 04:01:45.100
Shut up! Shut up!

04:01:45.100 --> 04:01:49.360
You guys! Get rid of these guys!

04:01:49.360 --> 04:01:52.640
If you're just going to get away with it, then I won't forgive you!

04:01:52.640 --> 04:01:53.960
Let's go, Gauri!

04:01:53.960 --> 04:01:55.420
Yeah!

04:01:55.420 --> 04:01:58.040
Disparanko!

04:02:28.920 --> 04:02:30.000
The Sword of Light!

04:02:30.700 --> 04:02:36.920
I can't believe... I can't believe they were able to do something so terrible!

04:02:36.920 --> 04:02:42.390
Heh... Now that I know it, this is the end of the children's game.

04:02:42.390 --> 04:02:44.110
Do it, Jirasu!

04:02:44.110 --> 04:02:55.720
Yesss!

04:02:55.720 --> 04:02:56.720
What was that just now?

04:02:56.720 --> 04:02:57.990
It's a bomb.

04:02:57.990 --> 04:03:00.000
Rezo was studying it a while ago.

04:03:00.480 --> 04:03:03.470
It's about a weapon that explodes when you light it.

04:03:03.470 --> 04:03:06.870
Explosion?

04:03:06.870 --> 04:03:09.590
What? It's not that surprising.

04:03:09.590 --> 04:03:12.210
After all, it's not enough for a spell to explode.

04:03:12.210 --> 04:03:15.490
That's why I stopped researching about it.

04:03:15.490 --> 04:03:17.390
What the hell are you talking about?

04:03:17.390 --> 04:03:18.950
I'm not stupid!

04:03:18.950 --> 04:03:21.660
I'll show you what I've got!

04:03:21.660 --> 04:03:23.060
Explosion Created!

04:03:23.060 --> 04:03:25.000
What?

04:03:40.780 --> 04:03:50.900
I don't know who called you, but I'm the one who called you.

04:04:00.000 --> 04:04:04.320
My body was made of rock golem and pig.

04:04:04.320 --> 04:04:10.540
Rock golem and pig?

04:04:10.540 --> 04:04:13.430
Hmph. I can't really compare it to a flying tool.

04:04:13.430 --> 04:04:16.410
Now, let's get serious and eat!

04:04:16.410 --> 04:04:18.900
What?

04:04:18.900 --> 04:04:19.590
Gargoyle!

04:04:35.080 --> 04:04:37.730
Now, thanks for your help.

04:04:37.730 --> 04:04:39.970
Please eat as much as you like.

04:04:39.970 --> 04:04:43.280
But... I'm already done eating.

04:05:10.330 --> 04:05:14.850
To the south of the desert of destruction, already outside the barrier?

04:05:14.850 --> 04:05:25.350
It's the first time I've ever thought that the food is delicious!

04:05:25.350 --> 04:05:27.440
Me too!

04:05:27.440 --> 04:05:29.050
Did you calm down?

04:05:29.050 --> 04:05:30.000
No, I was saved!

04:05:30.000 --> 04:05:39.050
I got it. They're a bunch of bandits who've been looting this area around here recently, and all the towns in this area have been affected.

04:05:39.050 --> 04:05:45.790
Well, if we go there, we won't be able to get close to this town for the rest of our lives.

04:05:45.790 --> 04:05:47.790
I don't think we'll ever be able to get close to it.

04:05:47.790 --> 04:05:49.790
Well, that's true.

04:05:57.180 --> 04:05:57.430
What?

04:06:02.880 --> 04:06:06.820
No way! That's Rina's drag slave!

04:06:06.820 --> 04:06:09.080
Amelia, Kaori, it's over!

04:06:09.080 --> 04:06:10.080
Rina!

04:06:10.080 --> 04:06:10.980
I know!

04:06:10.980 --> 04:06:17.250
What the hell is going on?

04:06:17.250 --> 04:06:19.300
Anyway, let's chase them!

04:06:19.300 --> 04:06:22.180
They're coming down!

04:07:03.800 --> 04:07:06.910
It would be great if we could have some delicious cookies with this.

04:07:06.910 --> 04:07:08.730
Oh, you're not going to eat?

04:07:08.730 --> 04:07:10.690
What do you mean?

04:07:10.690 --> 04:07:13.510
Who are you and what's your purpose?

04:07:13.510 --> 04:07:14.420
Explain it to me!

04:07:14.420 --> 04:07:19.510
Of course.

04:07:19.510 --> 04:07:22.510
I have something I have to tell you all.

04:07:22.510 --> 04:07:24.430
Did you know each other?

04:07:24.430 --> 04:07:25.430
Well, a little.

04:07:25.430 --> 04:07:29.410
I'm from the outside world that you call yours.

04:07:29.410 --> 04:07:30.000
In other words, this world is...

04:07:30.190 --> 04:07:34.190
I am a priestess who can be used in the Temple of the Fire Dragon King.

04:07:34.190 --> 04:07:36.370
A priestess of the Fire Dragon King?

04:07:36.370 --> 04:07:37.330
A priestess of the Dragon Clan?

04:07:37.330 --> 04:07:39.140
Yes.

04:07:39.140 --> 04:07:41.140
Then, what about the tail I saw?

04:07:41.140 --> 04:07:46.060
Yes, I'm not used to transforming into a human yet.

04:07:46.060 --> 04:07:48.160
Sometimes the tail sticks out.

04:07:48.160 --> 04:07:51.110
Oh, so that's what you can do.

04:07:51.110 --> 04:07:54.960
If you become a dragon of the Koi, I'll tell you that it's easy.

04:07:54.960 --> 04:07:59.800
That's what Mr. Milgazia, who took care of me in the Katart Mountains, did.

04:08:00.480 --> 04:08:04.400
So, why did that Ryuzoku priest attack us and Minato?

04:08:04.400 --> 04:08:08.180
Like I said before, it's to see through your power.

04:08:08.180 --> 04:08:10.140
See through my power?

04:08:10.140 --> 04:08:12.030
Are you attacking the town with that?

04:08:12.030 --> 04:08:15.030
I'm not harming the town.

04:08:15.030 --> 04:08:17.880
I'm only harming Ms. Rina.

04:08:17.880 --> 04:08:23.960
Besides, if you don't do something about it, I don't think you'll be able to survive from now on.

04:08:23.960 --> 04:08:25.070
From now on?

04:08:25.070 --> 04:08:30.000
From now on, I want you to follow the new plan to destroy the city.

04:08:30.190 --> 04:08:33.000
To tell of the destruction...

04:08:33.000 --> 04:08:34.170
Shintaku...

04:08:34.170 --> 04:08:42.530
Why is the sword of light, the Gorn Nova, in such a place?

04:08:42.530 --> 04:08:44.580
You surprise me.

04:08:44.580 --> 04:08:50.400
After all, that is also one of the weapons that our master, Balgarb, is looking for.

04:08:50.400 --> 04:08:53.450
I don't know why it's in such a place, though.

04:08:53.450 --> 04:08:55.720
The incident happened a few weeks ago.

04:08:55.720 --> 04:08:59.660
The words of Shintaku descended on the temple of the Fire Dragon King.

04:09:02.110 --> 04:09:06.950
Those who slip through the dark stars are called by the light, and fill this world with darkness.

04:09:06.950 --> 04:09:13.400
The shadow of the dragon's blood guides the power between darkness and light, and awakens the stars.

04:09:13.400 --> 04:09:15.200
Five lights that wrap the stars.

04:09:15.200 --> 04:09:27.530
Those who are even darker than the twilight, and even brighter than the dusk, are guided by the power, and give me a single arrow that pierces through the sky.

04:09:27.530 --> 04:09:29.890
These are the words of God's will.

04:09:30.320 --> 04:09:32.720
What is that?

04:09:32.720 --> 04:09:33.840
What does it mean?

04:09:33.840 --> 04:09:39.230
The first theory is that something that fills this world with darkness will come to this world.

04:09:39.230 --> 04:09:42.680
In other words, it represents the crisis of the world.

04:09:42.680 --> 04:09:46.320
The next is the power of darkness and light and the gap between them.

04:09:46.320 --> 04:09:51.510
We interpreted this as if it were a human being.

04:09:51.510 --> 04:10:00.000
Those who live in the gap between darkness and light are demons and gods.

04:10:00.190 --> 04:10:10.400
I don't know what you're talking about, but we decided that humans would be the key to avoiding this crisis, and we searched for someone with power.

04:10:10.400 --> 04:10:13.380
Humans are the world's crisis?

04:10:13.380 --> 04:10:14.530
Rina-san...

04:10:14.530 --> 04:10:27.010
