05:04:32.300 --> 05:04:35.380
It's a wonderful collaboration play, isn't it?

05:04:35.380 --> 05:04:38.460
They're all so drunk and mean.

05:04:38.460 --> 05:04:42.440
You're not going to say it's fair and square now, are you?

05:04:42.440 --> 05:04:45.660
Garb has overwhelmed us under the same conditions.

05:04:45.660 --> 05:04:49.580
Or is it just that the name Garb is just an exaggeration?

05:04:49.580 --> 05:04:50.860
I see.

05:04:50.860 --> 05:04:56.080
To prove that you're like Garb, you'll have to face everyone at the same time.

05:04:56.080 --> 05:04:57.860
Hehehehe.

05:04:57.860 --> 05:05:00.000
It's an over-the-top provocation.

05:05:00.030 --> 05:05:00.530
Die!

05:05:00.530 --> 05:05:01.030
No...

05:05:01.030 --> 05:05:03.620
I'll kill you!

05:05:03.620 --> 05:05:17.300
What the hell is this?!

05:05:17.300 --> 05:05:18.350
Ha ha ha!

05:05:18.350 --> 05:05:19.350
Ha ha ha!

05:05:19.350 --> 05:05:20.620
Uuugggh!

05:05:20.620 --> 05:05:27.170
Ha ha ha!

05:06:03.870 --> 05:06:05.640
What a shame, what a shame!

05:06:05.640 --> 05:06:08.440
I let you get away with it in the blink of an eye.

05:06:08.440 --> 05:06:11.780
I knew you were a tough opponent.

05:06:11.780 --> 05:06:17.510
Oh, it's a coincidence to meet you all in such a place.

05:06:17.510 --> 05:06:18.790
Veloth!

05:06:18.790 --> 05:06:25.160
What did you think I was going to say?

05:06:25.160 --> 05:06:26.560
You rascal!

05:06:26.560 --> 05:06:27.660
Hey, you!

05:06:27.660 --> 05:06:30.000
I can't believe you're using me!

05:06:31.720 --> 05:06:33.200
D-D-D-D-D-D...

05:06:33.200 --> 05:06:34.100
Huh?

05:06:34.100 --> 05:06:35.510
Did you understand?

05:06:35.510 --> 05:06:38.120
I don't understand!

05:06:38.120 --> 05:06:40.720
In other words, just like Garb, who betrayed the Demons,

05:06:40.720 --> 05:06:43.650
you were fighting Balgarb, who was the successor of Garb.

05:06:43.650 --> 05:06:44.710
Isn't that right?

05:06:44.710 --> 05:06:45.860
Y-Yes...

05:06:45.860 --> 05:06:51.280
On the other hand, Balgarb was trying to get revenge on his master,

05:06:51.280 --> 05:06:55.150
so he was aiming at Rina-san, who had destroyed Garb.

05:06:55.150 --> 05:06:57.520
And Rina-san, who was the bait,

05:06:57.520 --> 05:07:00.000
was trying to make it easy for the enemy to attack her.

05:07:02.140 --> 05:07:04.330
It's an unpleasant triangle relationship.

05:07:04.330 --> 05:07:07.690
But it's not easy to grab the tail.

05:07:07.690 --> 05:07:14.540
Balgarb suddenly gained strength and easily defeated the demon tribe he had left behind.

05:07:14.540 --> 05:07:18.410
Does that mean he's got some kind of powerful back?

05:07:18.410 --> 05:07:20.790
Well, that's something.

05:07:20.790 --> 05:07:24.840
In any case, it is certain that the troublemaker has become an enemy.

05:07:24.840 --> 05:07:29.510
Is this related to the world crisis that Filia was talking about?

05:07:30.480 --> 05:07:32.060
Hey, what happened to Filia?

05:07:32.060 --> 05:07:32.470
Huh?

05:07:32.470 --> 05:07:36.600
I forgot!

05:07:36.600 --> 05:07:37.880
Filia?

05:07:37.880 --> 05:07:38.930
It's Filia!

05:07:38.930 --> 05:07:50.940
Let me go, Lord Balgarb!

05:07:50.940 --> 05:07:52.620
I'll take out your sword!

05:07:52.620 --> 05:07:53.780
I'll let go of your hand!

05:07:53.780 --> 05:07:55.410
I won't get angry!

05:07:55.410 --> 05:07:58.960
This is it...

05:08:01.340 --> 05:08:04.560
Hmph. The Magician of Fujikome.

05:08:04.560 --> 05:08:05.870
I see.

05:08:05.870 --> 05:08:08.100
So this is how you use it.

05:08:08.100 --> 05:08:09.520
Alright, Krabos.

05:08:09.520 --> 05:08:13.280
You'll use this sword after they get close to this cave.

05:08:13.280 --> 05:08:15.410
Wait for my signal.

05:08:15.410 --> 05:08:16.960
But...

05:08:16.960 --> 05:08:20.390
You just have to do what I tell you to do.

05:08:20.390 --> 05:08:21.990
Lord Balgarb!

05:08:21.990 --> 05:08:23.460
Oh?

05:08:23.460 --> 05:08:27.310
You're telling me to use this Lagdame Degis?

05:08:27.310 --> 05:08:28.450
Yeah.

05:08:28.450 --> 05:08:30.000
It's the blood of the evil clan.

05:08:30.000 --> 05:08:32.420
You're making fun of me, aren't you?

05:08:32.420 --> 05:08:34.660
Hmph. What a pain in the ass.

05:08:34.660 --> 05:08:37.080
Well, that's fine.

05:08:37.080 --> 05:08:39.320
I'll give you a warning.

05:08:39.320 --> 05:08:42.790
You're not going to use your sword against Goren Noba.

05:08:42.790 --> 05:08:45.020
Oh, I see.

05:08:45.020 --> 05:08:46.550
Take it.

05:09:00.510 --> 05:09:26.900
Dump my phone company and switch to Vonage.

05:09:26.900 --> 05:09:30.000
Vonage has a flat rate, so you can call anybody, anything.

05:09:30.190 --> 05:09:34.220
anywhere in the United States. With Vonage, I get email notification if there's a

05:09:34.220 --> 05:09:38.060
voicemail waiting for me. That works well if I'm on the phone. The call clarity is

05:09:38.060 --> 05:09:44.070
terrific. Vonage is new and it's cool. I heard about Vonage from a friend. I like

05:09:44.070 --> 05:09:46.960
the service a lot. There's no long-distance charges and you get clear

05:09:46.960 --> 05:09:51.480
reception. Plus, it's great technology and a good way to save money. I call

05:09:51.480 --> 05:09:56.040
everywhere, all over the country, for one flat rate. We use Vonage for both our

05:09:56.040 --> 05:10:00.000
business and personal phone. In our business, we call our vendors in Asia

05:10:00.570 --> 05:10:05.200
customers across the country. Since we have Vonage, we can call them anytime we want and

05:10:05.200 --> 05:10:11.130
at the same low rate. The sound quality is the same as a regular phone. Price even better.

05:10:11.130 --> 05:10:18.670
Call 1-877-4-VONAGE now to get unlimited nationwide calling for only $39.99 a month.

05:10:18.670 --> 05:10:20.770
Vonage, the broadband phone company.

05:10:31.880 --> 05:10:37.930
I don't believe you're talking to a demon like this, even though you don't even care about me!

05:10:37.930 --> 05:10:39.930
It was my fault!

05:10:39.930 --> 05:10:44.790
Besides, this time you were the one who tried to lure Balgarb out.

05:10:44.790 --> 05:10:48.780
As a result, I was saved again.

05:10:48.780 --> 05:10:50.800
You don't have to say that.

05:10:50.800 --> 05:10:54.220
Zeroth, you were defeated by the dragon tribe in the battle of Koma.

05:10:54.220 --> 05:10:57.230
You were the only one who was able to drive the dragon tribe to destruction.

05:10:57.230 --> 05:11:00.000
You're one of those demons!

05:11:02.330 --> 05:11:03.770
Did something happen to you?

05:11:03.770 --> 05:11:06.250
I'm the one who saw Rina-san!

05:11:06.250 --> 05:11:09.290
I don't know what you're trying to do, but don't go anywhere!

05:11:09.290 --> 05:11:10.660
Don't get in my way!

05:11:10.660 --> 05:11:12.280
What do you mean, "get in my way"?

05:11:12.280 --> 05:11:13.910
Oh, I see.

05:11:13.910 --> 05:11:19.430
You were trying to make Rina-san into a broth, but I woke you up and you said it wasn't funny.

05:11:19.430 --> 05:11:24.540
A broth is a broth, but my goal is to save the world's machines.

05:11:24.540 --> 05:11:28.010
It's different from the personal broth of a demon.

05:11:28.010 --> 05:11:30.000
But a broth is a broth, right?

05:11:34.030 --> 05:11:35.950
They don't seem to get along at all.

05:11:35.950 --> 05:11:40.120
Well, they're the priests of the Fire Dragon King who can be used by the gods and the demons.

05:11:40.120 --> 05:11:42.930
This is also a connection from the Kouma War, isn't it?

05:11:42.930 --> 05:11:48.690
Anyway, let's calm down a bit here and sort out the past.

05:11:48.690 --> 05:11:54.100
Zeros, this time, I'll ask you to give me the information you know honestly.

05:11:54.100 --> 05:11:57.040
As far as I know, the enemy has three goals.

05:11:57.040 --> 05:11:57.880
Three?

05:11:57.880 --> 05:12:00.000
First of all, don't say one.

05:12:00.000 --> 05:12:02.560
The life of Ms. Rina.

05:12:02.560 --> 05:12:04.670
That's a huge revenge.

05:12:04.670 --> 05:12:07.010
It's a good place to get revenge.

05:12:07.010 --> 05:12:08.890
And the other one is...

05:12:08.890 --> 05:12:10.770
Gauri's Gorn Nova.

05:12:10.770 --> 05:12:12.680
In other words, the sword of light.

05:12:12.680 --> 05:12:14.570
Can I ask you one thing?

05:12:14.570 --> 05:12:16.570
What is that Gorn Nova?

05:12:16.570 --> 05:12:18.510
Your dialect?

05:12:18.510 --> 05:12:20.560
No, that's...

05:12:20.560 --> 05:12:22.560
Gorn Nova is the correct name.

05:12:22.560 --> 05:12:24.380
From ancient times.

05:12:24.380 --> 05:12:26.190
Hey!

05:12:26.190 --> 05:12:28.190
This sword is passed down from generation to generation.

05:12:28.190 --> 05:12:30.000
It's too early to talk about it.

05:12:30.510 --> 05:12:35.470
It's all right. It's all right. I accept your ownership of the sword.

05:12:35.470 --> 05:12:37.300
Rather, that's more convenient.

05:12:37.300 --> 05:12:39.350
What are you talking about?

05:12:39.350 --> 05:12:40.900
So, what's the other one?

05:12:40.900 --> 05:12:46.360
It seems that you are looking for something that is the same as the sword of light, or even more than that.

05:12:46.360 --> 05:12:56.260
For example, when we arrived on this continent, the people of the night party were trying their best to find something.

05:12:56.260 --> 05:12:58.400
Are they also called "Guru"?

05:12:58.400 --> 05:12:59.540
Idiot!

05:13:00.160 --> 05:13:06.050
Even if that's the truth, the weapons of the Sword of Light are everywhere in Sanjusogura!

05:13:06.050 --> 05:13:10.670
Yeah, but it's true that the enemy is looking for Chimanako.

05:13:10.670 --> 05:13:14.790
It seems that they were looking at the holy sword passed on to the sand tribe.

05:13:14.790 --> 05:13:16.650
The holy sword of the sand tribe...

05:13:16.650 --> 05:13:19.930
Wait, why do you even know that?

05:13:19.930 --> 05:13:26.320
Before I met Rina-san, I had confirmed with my own eyes that they were attacking the sand tribe's village.

05:13:26.320 --> 05:13:29.350
That means, by now, that village is...

05:13:33.290 --> 05:13:33.990
Right?

05:13:33.990 --> 05:13:34.640
What?

05:13:34.640 --> 05:13:38.770
I can't believe Zero-san would come to see the village being attacked!

05:13:38.770 --> 05:13:40.440
I can't believe it!

05:13:40.440 --> 05:13:46.060
Ah, but if Balgarb isn't here, it has nothing to do with me.

05:13:46.060 --> 05:13:48.920
Your office job is well-known.

05:13:48.920 --> 05:13:54.410
Anyway...

05:13:54.410 --> 05:13:55.480
Shall we go?

05:13:55.480 --> 05:13:56.550
Let's do it!

05:13:56.550 --> 05:14:00.000
I'll take the treasure of the Shunan tribe!

05:14:03.420 --> 05:14:09.070
Hey, was it Filia-san?

05:14:09.070 --> 05:14:10.980
How's Kariyo-san doing?

05:14:10.980 --> 05:14:16.570
"Namagoni"?

05:14:23.670 --> 05:14:26.180
"Namagoni"?

05:14:30.760 --> 05:14:42.500
Here it comes!

05:14:42.500 --> 05:14:43.130
Do it.

05:14:43.130 --> 05:14:46.100
No matter what happens, I don't care!

05:15:38.410 --> 05:15:40.960
As expected of a guardian who follows the rumors.

05:15:40.960 --> 05:15:43.360
Yeah, it's popular.

05:15:43.360 --> 05:15:45.390
What is this weird weapon?

05:15:45.390 --> 05:15:48.280
Hmm, did you like it?

05:15:48.280 --> 05:15:50.870
It's the same kind of weapon as the sword of light!

05:15:50.870 --> 05:15:52.080
What?

05:15:52.080 --> 05:15:54.770
The sword of light is just one.

05:15:54.770 --> 05:15:59.220
This is the real thing!

05:16:01.440 --> 05:16:03.440
I'll try it out then.

05:16:03.440 --> 05:16:05.410
Tch!

05:16:05.410 --> 05:16:11.650
You're not going to end it.

05:16:11.650 --> 05:16:15.960
I told you to run!

05:16:15.960 --> 05:16:18.140
What's going on?

05:16:18.140 --> 05:16:20.090
It's his fault!

05:16:20.090 --> 05:16:23.090
He's the one who pulled the monster out!

05:16:23.090 --> 05:16:24.360
Then...

05:16:24.360 --> 05:16:25.920
I see.

05:16:25.920 --> 05:16:26.880
Mr. Zero!

05:16:26.880 --> 05:16:30.000
The Suna Clan's sacred sword is the one that can seal the monster.

05:16:30.000 --> 05:16:32.000
It seems that it was just a simple key to keep in mind.

05:16:32.000 --> 05:16:34.000
Please do something about it!

05:16:34.000 --> 05:16:38.000
No, if I do something on my own, I will be scolded by the king of the beast again.

05:16:38.000 --> 05:16:40.000
It is a guy who eats blood.

05:16:41.970 --> 05:16:47.060
I don't know what it is, but I can see it now!

05:16:47.060 --> 05:16:49.560
Wait!

05:16:49.560 --> 05:16:55.550
I can't help but forget it again!

05:16:55.550 --> 05:16:56.440
What?

05:16:56.440 --> 05:16:57.560
What?

05:16:57.560 --> 05:16:58.230
What?

05:17:02.140 --> 05:17:03.790
Are you satisfied with this?

05:17:03.790 --> 05:17:05.640
Hmph, people are bad.

05:17:05.640 --> 05:17:08.280
Did you already get what you were looking for?

05:17:08.280 --> 05:17:10.550
What is one of them?

05:17:10.550 --> 05:17:11.580
One?

05:17:11.580 --> 05:17:13.080
There's still something like that!

05:17:13.080 --> 05:17:15.160
Yeah, let's go for real.

05:17:15.160 --> 05:17:17.890
It's boring if I don't do that.

05:17:17.890 --> 05:17:21.810
Now, hurry up and bring that sword to the original place!

05:17:21.810 --> 05:17:22.510
All right!

05:17:22.510 --> 05:17:23.940
Please let me go!

05:17:23.940 --> 05:17:26.040
So, what's the original place?

05:17:26.040 --> 05:17:29.920
Probably, in that temple.

05:17:31.790 --> 05:17:33.150
Where are you?

05:17:33.150 --> 05:17:34.770
How much weight do you weigh?

05:17:34.770 --> 05:17:35.930
Huh?

05:17:35.930 --> 05:17:38.100
I'm asking you seriously.

05:17:42.800 --> 05:17:45.610
Thirteen in height, twenty in height.

05:17:45.610 --> 05:17:47.830
Um, Mr. Velgadis?

05:17:47.830 --> 05:17:49.990
Don't worry, I'll go at once.

05:17:49.990 --> 05:17:52.980
Bomb Dewey!

05:18:04.830 --> 05:18:15.900
Kino-san?

05:18:15.900 --> 05:18:22.660
You think I'm strong?

05:18:22.660 --> 05:18:23.660
I'll fight you!

05:18:23.660 --> 05:18:28.000
I was born to be a Jouhatsu!

05:19:15.360 --> 05:19:17.360
We're going to finish them off in one blow!

05:19:17.360 --> 05:19:18.880
But why?!

05:19:18.880 --> 05:19:21.540
What are you talking about?

05:19:21.540 --> 05:19:26.730
We're going to be beaten to death!

05:19:26.730 --> 05:19:28.580
You think we're going to let them get away like this?!

05:19:33.200 --> 05:19:36.670
Kill them!

05:19:36.670 --> 05:19:49.630
You've stopped the magic!

05:19:49.630 --> 05:19:57.910
It's surprising. It's not that I stopped it, but the magic itself is meaningless to them.

05:20:07.840 --> 05:20:17.690
I'll kill you...

05:20:17.690 --> 05:20:21.190
It seems like another incredible battle is about to begin.

05:20:21.190 --> 05:20:25.040
Is that what fills the darkness in this world?

05:20:25.040 --> 05:20:26.700
It seems so.

05:20:26.700 --> 05:20:29.380
Your choice shows...

05:20:30.440 --> 05:20:32.690
He is the father of the world.

05:20:32.690 --> 05:20:43.990
He is the best in the world from the land of mystery.

05:22:17.020 --> 05:22:20.640
It's been a month since I landed on a land I don't even know the name of.

05:22:20.640 --> 05:22:22.910
I've been through a lot because of Filia's guidance.

05:22:22.910 --> 05:22:26.580
Now I'm just looking at the ruins on the map.

05:22:26.580 --> 05:22:30.000
The knowledge I've been given by Rezo has shown me where I am now.

05:22:30.440 --> 05:22:37.520
It's a temple for the King of Valkyries, it's right there!

05:22:37.520 --> 05:22:41.810
Where should I go in front of the land of the unknown?

05:22:41.810 --> 05:22:43.960
My name is Zergadis.

05:22:43.960 --> 05:22:48.830
I'm a sad remodeled human being who will obliterate the soul.

05:22:48.830 --> 05:22:53.450
Rurouruten! The journey of the Orpheus Temple!

05:23:00.030 --> 05:23:02.560
Once we reach it, we'll be at the Karyuoh Temple!

05:23:02.560 --> 05:23:06.920
Ah, now we can take the first step to save the world!

05:23:06.920 --> 05:23:13.740
Ugh, what is this?

05:23:13.740 --> 05:23:17.190
We've been walking for a whole day, but we haven't gotten any closer.

05:23:17.190 --> 05:23:20.710
How long will it take to get to the Karyuoh Temple?

05:23:20.710 --> 05:23:22.940
I don't know.

05:23:22.940 --> 05:23:27.680
I think it'll take about three days to keep running at full speed during the day and night.

05:23:27.680 --> 05:23:29.760
Gah, I can't take it anymore.

05:23:30.160 --> 05:23:31.160
I can't move because I'm hungry.

05:23:31.160 --> 05:23:33.140
As expected of the continent.

05:23:33.140 --> 05:23:35.240
You're a terrible heroine.

05:23:35.240 --> 05:23:38.090
I was careless because I could see it.

05:23:38.090 --> 05:23:41.690
I can't walk anymore no matter what happens.

05:23:41.690 --> 05:23:43.690
Shall we go to the farm here?

05:23:43.690 --> 05:23:48.720
I don't feel like it, but it can't be helped.

05:23:48.720 --> 05:23:51.720
Everyone was full of energy until just now.

05:23:51.720 --> 05:23:54.740
How many hours ago are you talking about?

05:23:54.740 --> 05:23:57.670
There's no more reserve anywhere.

05:23:57.670 --> 05:24:00.000
But we have to save the world from the new house of destruction.

05:24:00.800 --> 05:24:03.940
We're going to be the ones to die in front of the world!

05:24:04.270 --> 05:24:06.180
Oh, Rina-san! Rina-saaan!

05:24:07.260 --> 05:24:10.100
I can see the light a little further away!

05:24:10.100 --> 05:24:10.720
Huh?

05:24:10.720 --> 05:24:17.070
Now we can finally get some food!

05:24:17.070 --> 05:24:18.050
Food?

05:24:18.050 --> 05:24:20.130
Yes! Food! Food!

05:24:20.130 --> 05:24:21.570
As long as we can eat, anything is fine!

05:24:21.570 --> 05:24:22.750
Rina, let's go!

05:24:22.750 --> 05:24:24.030
Let's go, Kaori!

05:24:24.030 --> 05:24:26.990
Food! Food! Food!

05:24:26.990 --> 05:24:29.860
There's so much left...

05:24:30.860 --> 05:24:32.140
Shall we go, too?

05:24:32.140 --> 05:24:38.800
Oh, those are ruins, aren't they?

05:24:38.800 --> 05:24:42.040
Compared to that, it's a small town, isn't it?

05:24:42.040 --> 05:24:44.040
The name of this town is "Explena".

05:24:44.040 --> 05:24:47.510
Those huge ruins are the tourist attractions of this town.

05:24:47.510 --> 05:24:50.230
It seems that they are from thousands of years ago.

05:24:50.230 --> 05:24:52.230
Ruins are just a matter of time!

05:24:52.230 --> 05:24:54.430
More importantly, the bus is just a meal, a meal!

05:24:54.430 --> 05:24:56.410
Let's go!

05:24:56.410 --> 05:24:57.940
Let's go, let's go, let's go!

05:25:01.240 --> 05:25:05.250
I have to do something about them before I can get the Goron Nova.

05:25:05.250 --> 05:25:07.660
It's okay. I'll give you this.

05:25:07.660 --> 05:25:09.220
The Brûlix's body...

05:25:09.220 --> 05:25:10.600
The giant ogre...

05:25:10.600 --> 05:25:12.160
Is it Ichikoro?

05:25:12.160 --> 05:25:25.990
It's my wife.

05:25:25.990 --> 05:25:26.850
Don't worry about it.

05:25:26.850 --> 05:25:28.360
Old man! The watermelon's not here yet!

05:25:28.360 --> 05:25:30.000
Watermelon!

05:25:30.250 --> 05:25:33.330
Well, it's already closed, you know.

05:25:33.330 --> 05:25:34.750
Suika!

05:25:34.750 --> 05:25:37.240
What? I'm doing it right now!

05:25:37.240 --> 05:25:46.400
Hey, Filia.

05:25:46.400 --> 05:25:48.390
The ruins we saw earlier...

05:25:48.390 --> 05:25:51.000
From the building's perspective, they're the Ryuzoku's, right?

05:25:51.000 --> 05:25:52.180
That's right.

05:25:52.180 --> 05:25:54.890
But right now, no one is allowed to go inside.

05:25:54.890 --> 05:25:56.440
It's a sealed ruins.

05:25:56.440 --> 05:25:59.510
A sealed ruins, huh...

05:26:02.240 --> 05:26:05.240
Now is the time to save the world from the burden of destruction!

05:26:05.240 --> 05:26:07.240
Keep your energy and go to sleep!

05:26:07.240 --> 05:26:09.240
We're leaving tomorrow morning!

05:26:09.240 --> 05:26:12.240
Besides, Rina-san, how long are you going to eat?

05:26:12.240 --> 05:26:15.640
Because I still haven't received the extra order!

05:26:15.640 --> 05:26:17.640
You're still going to eat?

05:26:17.640 --> 05:26:18.640
Hey, wait!

05:26:18.640 --> 05:26:20.780
Yes, wait, wait!

05:26:20.780 --> 05:26:23.700
This is the dish that I'm proud of!

05:26:23.700 --> 05:26:25.700
Hurry up and taste it!

05:26:25.700 --> 05:26:27.700
And go home already!

05:26:27.700 --> 05:26:28.530
It looks delicious!

05:26:28.530 --> 05:26:30.000
Let's eat!

05:26:47.950 --> 05:26:48.660
It did.

05:27:02.970 --> 05:27:04.480
What? She's asleep.

05:27:04.480 --> 05:27:06.950
She sleeps so well.

05:27:06.950 --> 05:27:11.430
Miria was on her own, but she's actually tired.

05:27:11.430 --> 05:27:15.360
Please give me a raise, Master Saichourou.

05:27:15.360 --> 05:27:24.480
You're cheating.

05:27:24.480 --> 05:27:27.650
Rina.

05:27:27.650 --> 05:27:29.760
Sekikan.

05:27:30.120 --> 05:27:32.620
It feels like there is a treasure here.

05:27:33.120 --> 05:27:37.760
If we're here, we might be able to find a way to restore Mr. Zergalis's body.

05:27:38.200 --> 05:27:38.740
Yeah.

05:27:39.350 --> 05:27:41.850
I don't care, but Filia's body is heavy.

05:27:42.350 --> 05:27:43.850
It's quite different from what it looks like.

05:27:44.350 --> 05:27:46.660
Well, it's actually a dragon.

05:27:47.240 --> 05:27:48.740
Isn't that heavier than a normal person?

05:27:49.240 --> 05:27:55.590
So that dragon woman is the one who ate Lurie's sleeping fruit?

05:27:56.090 --> 05:27:56.950
What are we going to do, boss?

05:27:57.450 --> 05:28:00.000
What are we going to do? We have no choice but to chase her!

05:28:05.790 --> 05:28:09.720
- Hey, Rina. - What? What's wrong?

05:28:09.720 --> 05:28:15.620
- Look at this. - Oh, Rina, you're quite...

05:28:15.620 --> 05:28:18.860
- So? What does it say? - I don't know.

05:28:18.860 --> 05:28:30.000
But I think the other side of this wall is a big room.

05:28:30.000 --> 05:28:33.800
I think it's a good idea to go to the other room with this keyword, but...

05:28:33.800 --> 05:28:35.060
Oh my, oh my.

05:28:35.060 --> 05:28:40.280
Since when did you change from a thief killer to a tomb raider?

05:28:40.280 --> 05:28:41.860
Zeros!

05:28:41.860 --> 05:28:44.790
Well, even so, Rina-san.

05:28:44.790 --> 05:28:50.520
It's a bad thing to quietly take a dragon's treasure.

05:28:50.520 --> 05:28:52.400
I don't want to be told by you!

05:28:52.400 --> 05:28:55.120
Anyway, Zeros, can't you read this letter?

05:28:55.120 --> 05:28:56.900
Huh? Which one?

05:28:56.900 --> 05:28:58.740
Hmm, hmm, hmm.

05:29:00.160 --> 05:29:01.740
I see...

05:29:01.740 --> 05:29:03.660
W-What does it say?

05:29:03.660 --> 05:29:09.040
In ancient times, this land had a high-level civilization.

05:29:09.040 --> 05:29:12.920
In ancient times? When there was the Koma War?

05:29:12.920 --> 05:29:15.990
No, this ruins was made thousands of years ago.

05:29:15.990 --> 05:29:19.630
The technology and law of tens of thousands of years ago have been established,

05:29:19.630 --> 05:29:23.060
and the knowledge and technology of the Clearbible class have been used.

05:29:23.060 --> 05:29:25.330
The Clearbible class?

05:29:25.330 --> 05:29:30.000
That's...

05:29:31.850 --> 05:29:33.780
I can't read it.

05:29:33.780 --> 05:29:38.170
Oh, but I'm sure you can read it, Filia.

05:29:38.170 --> 05:29:40.170
I see, I see.

05:29:40.170 --> 05:29:42.170
Zell, wake up Filia.

05:29:42.990 --> 05:29:45.840
Hey, wake up, Filia.

05:29:45.840 --> 05:29:48.340
Hey.

05:29:48.340 --> 05:29:51.240
I can't help it.

05:29:51.240 --> 05:29:54.110
Nebolt!

05:29:54.110 --> 05:29:55.740
Stop it!

05:29:55.740 --> 05:29:58.750
If you do that, I'll die before I wake up!

05:29:58.750 --> 05:30:00.000
Just once.

05:30:00.000 --> 05:30:03.650
What's this? It's just a reflection!

05:30:32.360 --> 05:30:34.930
So the dragon clan itself was the key!

05:30:36.080 --> 05:30:40.150
There's no time to say that! We have to get out of here as fast as we can!

05:30:40.150 --> 05:30:51.250
Please be careful of the closing doors.

05:31:13.400 --> 05:31:15.400
Thank you for coming.

05:31:15.400 --> 05:31:18.380
Next stop, Kariudo Shrine.

05:31:18.380 --> 05:31:21.240
Kariudo Shrine.

05:31:21.240 --> 05:31:22.380
What is it?

05:31:22.380 --> 05:31:26.790
Let's go!

05:31:46.860 --> 05:31:49.600
Hey, what are you looking at?

05:31:49.600 --> 05:31:55.900
Ryuzoku's seat was left as it was.

05:31:55.900 --> 05:31:57.150
I see.

05:31:57.150 --> 05:31:59.760
It was Ryuzoku's transportation system.

05:32:00.320 --> 05:32:03.500
Now we can go to the temple of the Karyuu King in one fell swoop, can't we?

05:32:03.500 --> 05:32:05.500
What are you talking about?

05:32:05.500 --> 05:32:08.780
There are so many cities ahead of us!

05:32:08.780 --> 05:32:11.320
If we keep going, we'll end up in the third world!

05:32:11.320 --> 05:32:12.400
Damn you!

05:32:12.400 --> 05:32:14.060
I won't forgive you!

05:32:14.060 --> 05:32:16.020
Then I'll see you later.

05:32:16.020 --> 05:32:18.180
I won't forgive you!

05:32:18.180 --> 05:32:20.390
Anyway, don't mess with me!

05:32:20.390 --> 05:32:21.590
Is that okay?

05:32:21.590 --> 05:32:27.590
I don't care!

05:32:27.590 --> 05:32:28.260
I'll get you!

05:32:30.830 --> 05:32:43.320
I thought you were going to move the ruins and run away from us, but you can't do that. No one thinks that stupid thing.

05:32:43.320 --> 05:32:52.320
Stop the ruins and the light sword. Otherwise, I'll tear it apart.

05:32:52.320 --> 05:32:59.060
I'm going to fight you. I'm going to fight you. I'm going to fight you.

05:33:09.820 --> 05:33:17.670
The power of magic has been taken away from this ruins, and the ruins are moving by using it as a power source!

05:33:17.670 --> 05:33:20.310
Tell me that quickly!

05:33:20.310 --> 05:33:23.390
Ah! My sword of light is...

05:33:23.390 --> 05:33:27.280
Anyway, the energy called energy is absorbed by everything!

05:33:27.280 --> 05:33:28.130
Ne! Ha!

05:33:30.280 --> 05:33:35.000
If you can't use magic and that kind of sword, there's nothing to be afraid of.

05:33:35.000 --> 05:33:37.810
This is what it means to twist and crush the Red Riding Hood!

05:33:37.810 --> 05:33:40.790
Is that really true?!

05:33:40.790 --> 05:33:43.680
But, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but, but...

05:33:43.680 --> 05:33:45.430
You said it so quietly...

05:33:45.430 --> 05:33:48.180
There's no time to be proud!

05:34:20.510 --> 05:34:22.440
I'm not joking!

05:34:22.440 --> 05:34:24.850
No matter how hard I try, this speed is abnormal!

05:34:24.850 --> 05:34:26.750
That means...

05:34:26.750 --> 05:34:28.920
It's rampant!

05:34:28.920 --> 05:34:29.600
Ah!

05:34:30.000 --> 05:34:31.500
It's a heavy equipment.

05:34:31.500 --> 05:34:33.100
What are you going to do with it?

05:34:33.100 --> 05:34:34.440
Well, that's it.

05:34:34.440 --> 05:34:35.980
Are you going to run away?

05:34:35.980 --> 05:34:38.080
What are you going to do with the temple of Kariyō-sama?

05:34:38.080 --> 05:34:38.960
What are you talking about?

05:34:38.960 --> 05:34:40.690
It's a life-threatening thing.

05:34:40.690 --> 05:34:43.700
If you take that attitude,

05:34:43.700 --> 05:34:45.600
I'll tell my sister.

05:34:45.600 --> 05:34:46.380
What?

05:34:46.380 --> 05:34:47.820
You coward!

05:34:47.820 --> 05:34:48.940
If you don't like that,

05:34:48.940 --> 05:34:51.120
I'll find a way to stop you.

05:34:51.120 --> 05:34:54.550
Ah!

05:34:54.550 --> 05:34:56.310
Kariyō-san!

05:35:00.640 --> 05:35:02.650
Let's go back to the temple!

05:35:02.650 --> 05:35:04.650
We might be able to stop it now.

05:35:04.650 --> 05:35:07.010
The dead man is coming out!

05:35:07.010 --> 05:35:09.010
The king who protects the temple...

05:35:09.010 --> 05:35:11.010
It's a great miracle...

05:35:11.010 --> 05:35:14.240
Don't lie to me!

05:35:14.240 --> 05:35:16.390
The tea is delicious.

05:35:30.190 --> 05:35:31.290
Are you okay?

05:35:31.290 --> 05:35:33.040
Yes, somehow.

05:35:33.040 --> 05:35:36.220
Hey! You didn't do anything wrong earlier!

05:35:39.630 --> 05:35:41.870
You're as strong as ever!

05:35:42.900 --> 05:35:45.200
Shut up.

05:35:45.200 --> 05:35:52.220
It's been a while since I've defeated a prey with a sword.

05:35:52.220 --> 05:35:53.880
I'm not going to make a fuss.

05:35:53.880 --> 05:35:57.040
What? What are you doing?

05:35:57.040 --> 05:36:00.000
What? What are you doing?

05:36:01.660 --> 05:36:07.330
Oh, yeah.

05:36:31.150 --> 05:36:32.980
That's amazing!

05:36:32.980 --> 05:36:36.900
Well, whatever. We have no choice but to stop the ruins.

05:36:36.900 --> 05:36:38.520
Is there any way?

05:36:38.520 --> 05:36:43.270
I'm going to destroy it.

05:36:43.270 --> 05:36:44.430
What?

05:36:44.430 --> 05:36:47.430
If we destroy the container that has the magic in it...

05:36:47.430 --> 05:36:49.110
Where is it?

05:36:49.110 --> 05:36:51.970
I don't know!

05:36:51.970 --> 05:36:55.450
Alright! We'll destroy anything that looks like it!

05:36:55.450 --> 05:36:57.400
- Okay! - Okay!

05:37:07.000 --> 05:37:10.700
Once again, the town is gone.

05:37:10.700 --> 05:37:13.510
We're almost at the end of the area.

05:37:13.510 --> 05:37:15.410
The Dragon King's temple.

05:37:15.410 --> 05:37:18.240
Please make sure you don't forget it.

05:37:18.240 --> 05:37:23.620
It's an important cultural treasure!

05:37:23.620 --> 05:37:30.000
I tried to break it, but...

05:37:30.600 --> 05:37:32.490
There's nothing like that.

05:37:32.490 --> 05:37:36.240
What's left is...

05:37:36.240 --> 05:37:37.590
That.

05:37:37.590 --> 05:37:39.170
That's no good!

05:37:39.170 --> 05:37:43.040
For Ryuto-kun, that body is sacred and important!

05:37:43.040 --> 05:37:44.060
It's fine.

05:37:44.060 --> 05:37:45.360
Kaori, do it.

05:37:45.360 --> 05:37:46.000
Yes!

05:37:46.000 --> 05:37:47.860
Hikariyo!

05:37:49.470 --> 05:37:50.390
Wait a minute.

05:38:08.120 --> 05:38:09.220
All right!

05:38:09.220 --> 05:38:18.280
I can't reach the sword.

05:38:18.280 --> 05:38:28.230
How about I give you the sword of light?

05:38:28.230 --> 05:38:30.000
Shut up!

05:38:33.290 --> 05:38:35.150
You can't do it like you did last time!

05:38:35.150 --> 05:38:35.650
Do it!

05:38:35.650 --> 05:38:36.650
Come on!

05:38:36.650 --> 05:38:50.560
Even if you don't do it, it's as strong as a fireball.

05:38:50.560 --> 05:38:51.580
Is that so?

05:38:51.580 --> 05:38:53.880
Huh?

05:39:01.880 --> 05:39:11.840
- Let's go! - Let's go!

05:39:30.700 --> 05:39:32.810
Well, that's all we can do.

05:39:32.810 --> 05:39:37.020
Even if we run out of power, we'll just have to run around for a while.

05:39:37.020 --> 05:39:38.020
Jiratsu-yo!

05:39:38.020 --> 05:39:41.020
Everyone, are you ready? We're going to escape from here!

05:39:41.020 --> 05:39:44.100
Escape? We haven't stopped moving!

05:39:44.100 --> 05:39:46.140
Vilya, transform into a dragon.

05:39:46.140 --> 05:39:48.160
I'm sure I can do that!

05:39:48.160 --> 05:39:50.160
Transform!

05:39:50.160 --> 05:39:51.160
Yo!

05:40:02.360 --> 05:40:04.360
Not at all! Not at all!

05:40:04.360 --> 05:40:06.780
Alright! I'll blow you away at once!

05:40:07.790 --> 05:40:11.720
Darker than the twilight, redder than the flow of blood.

05:40:11.720 --> 05:40:15.240
In the name of the great Nanji, who killed the flow of time.

05:40:15.240 --> 05:40:17.060
I swear to the darkness here.

05:40:17.060 --> 05:40:24.580
We will win the battle and give all foolish things power and unity to the Nanji!

05:40:34.480 --> 05:40:35.230
I did it!

05:40:35.230 --> 05:40:36.020
I did it!

05:40:36.020 --> 05:40:37.250
Just in time!

05:40:37.250 --> 05:40:39.570
I'm so glad!

05:40:39.570 --> 05:40:51.920
Hello!

05:41:05.400 --> 05:41:07.280
We're here.

05:41:07.280 --> 05:41:09.130
We're here.

05:41:09.130 --> 05:41:10.780
We're here, indeed.

05:41:10.780 --> 05:41:13.520
It's strange that you're here.

05:41:13.520 --> 05:41:15.900
What a mess.

05:41:15.900 --> 05:41:18.610
After all, we're at the Emperor Karyuu's temple.

05:41:18.610 --> 05:41:20.070
Hey, Illya!

05:41:20.070 --> 05:41:20.870
Illya!

05:41:23.650 --> 05:41:24.690
Oh, my!

05:41:24.690 --> 05:41:26.350
What a mess!

05:41:26.350 --> 05:41:28.390
Zero-san!

05:41:28.390 --> 05:41:29.220
Illya!

05:41:30.160 --> 05:41:31.270
A little bit...

05:41:31.270 --> 05:41:32.270
HIRIA!

05:41:32.270 --> 05:41:34.120
HIRIA!

05:41:34.120 --> 05:41:38.980
WALT DISNEY STUDIO'S PRES-
